<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">YOANI</book>
  <para style="toc3">Yoa</para>
  <para style="toc2">YOANI</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mwako Mopele ma Yoani</para>
  <para style="mt1">YOANI</para>
  <para style="imt1">Eingeli</para>
  <para style="ip">Mwako Mopele ma Yoani makomama ta tina ɛ iputo la badhimi ibahelaka ta Sulia kaoko ta Adji Minɛlɛ, hadɛdi edii ekomi ɛ Tiliki.</para>
  <para style="ip">Buku ɛ Yoani etikoani na Miako Mipele mikina imakoma bamina nde. Oko yo buki akoma midjɔ mikina imadaa bamina nde pɛpɛ okoma elengɛɛ tɛkɛ ɛ moki ta Kana (2, 1-12), na masaka ma Yesu nɔbɔ Nikodɛmɛ (3, 1-21), nɔbɔ mwali mosamalia (4, 1-12), nɔbɔ etumbɛ ta Betesaida (5, 1-18), nɔbɔ moto ɔbotama miso mago (9, 1-41), akoma midjɔ mikɛkɛ ma mohelo ma Yesu ehole ɛdaka yo ta ngondo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ta ibange (1, 1-18) la Mwako Mopele ma Yoani, Yesu aenɛmi elengɛɛ Ebaeli ɛ Ndjambe. Yo ona oodii mohelo, ohuu na sooti adoa ahela engbanga na bato.</para>
  <para style="ip">Buku hee edii na bikenge binɛnɛ bibae: ogwa ba Yesu na opusoa ba nde (2, 4; 12, 23)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ekenge ɛ boso ɛpaka tati (1, 19; 12, 50): Yoani Mobatisi, motingami ɔ nde Andele, Pilipo, na Natanɛlɛ, moto na moto atɔndɔkɔ moda imaenɛ yo Yesu. Ngɔngɔ djia masaka mindumba na mindumba ma Yesu na mikɔ ma okamoa saambo elengɛɛ «bimbete». Yoani asukedjai ekenge ena na midjɔ ma tina ma bileho ba Yesu (12, 37-50).</para>
  <para style="ip">Ena ɔimea ehole ɛ ogwa (13, 1), Yesu akinea batingami ba nde bilomu ibidii elengɛɛ mosise ma nde ma mwembo (13-16). Ta miongɔɔnɔ, Yesu asaboanedja tina ɛ osako na ogwa na opa Sango midjɔ imikɔmɔlea ngɔngɔ dja nde (17).</para>
  <para style="ip">Bea, ngɔngɔ akoma tina ɛ opeama, etumbu na obakama ba Yesu ta ekulusu, otaneama ba mobombo bwase, Yoani akoma moda momɔti na Miako mikina Mipele (18-20).</para>
  <para style="ip">Busa ba tɛkɛ ɛ Pasika Yesu aenɛmɛ odii Malia ɔ ngando ɛ Magadala, odii batingami, na onɔ Toma.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ekenge ɛ 21 (batingami saambo na Piɛlɛ, basaki na Yesu ta ibeke inɛnɛ la Tibeliade).</para>
  <para style="ip">(20, 31) Endolo bii bakomama bɛngɛ odhimeni boo Yesu adii Masia, Mwana ɔ Ndjambe, ko okamodhimeani, ɔdihebini mohelo na ndjia ɛ nde.</para>
  <para style="ip">Bea mokomeli ɔ Mwako Mopele abalaka boo: akoma buku ɛ nde bɛngɛ boo bato ibadaa pɛpɛ oenɛ Yesu, ibo bamodhimee koko boo: «Adii ndjia, sooti ko mohelo» (14, 6).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu Klisto adii Ebaeli ɛdonga odii Ndjambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Donga ibange Ebaeli adaka. Ebaeli adaka engbanga na Ndjambe ko Ebaeli adaka Ndjambe. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Ta ibange Ebaeli adaka engbanga na Ndjambe. <verse eid="JHN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Na ndjia ɛnde Ndjambe ayoa leka losusu ko pɛpɛ eka emɔti ɛtaka oyoama na nde. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Ta tei ɛnde ɛdaka mohelo, ko mohelo madaka ohuu ba bato. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Ohuu bodii ongɛngɛ ta ndanda ɛ modidi, endolo modidi maimosɔ.<verse eid="JHN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Ndjambe aloma moto ona ɔbeamaka Yoani. <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />Yo adoa elengɛɛ temo, tin'ɛ opa tati ɛ ohuu, bɛngɛ bato basusu badime na ndjia ɛnde. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Yoani yo mɛɛnɛ aidaka ohuu, endolo adaka temo ɛ ohuu.<verse eid="JHN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Ohuu bua badaka ohuu ba sooti. Ɔdua bo ta ngondo, bahoodja bato basusu.<verse eid="JHN 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Yo ona ɔdaka Ebaeli adaka ta tei ɛ ngondo, ko Ndjambe akɔɔ ngondo na nde, endolo ngondo ɛimodjeba. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />Ebaeli adoa odii denga la nde mɛɛnɛ, endolo denga la nde baimoosɔ. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Endolo bato basusu ibamosɔ ko badhima kombe ɛ nde; abapa kpati ɛ oimea bana ba Ndjambe. <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />Baimea bana ba Ndjambe na obotama na ndjia ɛ moto, kaoko na ndjia ɛ olulea ba moto; endolo na olulea ba Ndjambe.<verse eid="JHN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Ona odii Ebaeli aimea moto ko ahela ta ndanda ɛ booso, molumake na ndjokwa ko na sooti. Laenɛ ekumu ɛnde, ekumu ɛ Mwana ɔ ikinda ɛna ɛosi yo odii Sango.<verse eid="JHN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />Yoani apa tati ɛnde; agamaka boo: «Hokeani ona obalaka mbai ta tina ɛ nde boo: “Ona ɔduake ngɔngɔ dja mbai anɔini, tina ɛ boo adaka ehele boso ba mbai.”» <verse eid="JHN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Elɛngɛɛ oluma yo na epaeli tin'ɛ booso, alopa ndjokwa diko la ndjokwa. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Ekadaa boo Mibeko mapama odii so na ndjia ɛ Mose; ndjokwa ko na sooti ladua na ndjia ɛ Yesu Klisto. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Pɛpɛ noko moto omɔti ɔenɛ Ndjambe. Endolo Mwana ɔ ikinda, ona odii Ndjambe ko ɔyeyoa mbuti na Sango, yo mɛɛnɛ akɔɔ boo lamodjebe.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tati ɛ Yoani Mobatisi</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat 3, 1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mal 1, 1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk 3, 1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Hokeani tati ɛ Yoani ehole ɛloma bakumu ba Bayuda ba nganga ba Ndjambe na ba lewi donga Yelusalɛmɛ bɛngɛ bamohɔdjae boo: «Wɛ odii nda?» <verse eid="JHN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Yoani ailona obasɔmbɛdja, endolo abala ohuu boso ba bato basusu boo: «Naditi Masia.» <verse eid="JHN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />Bamohɔdja boo: «Wɛ ko nda? Edii wɛ Elia?» Yoani asɔmbɛdja «Pɛpɛ, naditi Elia.» – «Edii wɛ motɛli?» Yoani abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Pɛpɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Bea bamohɔdja boo: «Bea wɛ ko nda? Oboani so osɔmbɛdja odii bato ibalolomi enao. Ebali wɛ diko la wɛ mɛɛnɛ yee?» <verse eid="JHN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Yoani asɔmbɛdja boo: «Nadii</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:23">“ona ɔdumbeaka ta esobe boo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:23">Ninodjani ndjia ɛ Kumu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa 40,3</char></note>!”»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 1:23">Moda imabala motɛli Isaya.<verse eid="JHN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Bato ibaloma bo odii Yoani badaka Bafalusai; <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />bamohɔdja koko boo: «Omiti daa Masia, Elia, Motɛli, tina ɛinaka nawɛ bato nda?» <verse eid="JHN 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Yoani abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Mbai, naoinakani na madiba; endolo ta ndanda ɛ boono moto adii ona ɔdaka no pɛpɛ odjeba. <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />Adoake ngɔngɔ dja mbai, ko naboaniti noko oloodja nguulu dja sapato dja nde.» <verse eid="JHN 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Midjɔ mia misusu manɔkɔ ta Betania, ta dɔngɔ la dua la Yolodani, oho ɔinaka Yoani bato.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu, Mwana ɔ bhata ɔ Ndjambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Ngɔngɔ dja iswi imɔti, Yoani aenɛ Yesu adoe odii yo, ko abala boo: «Hokeani Mwana ɔ bhata ɔ Ndjambe ona ɔdongedjaka masumu ma ngondo. <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Edii tina ɛ nde naotɔndɔkini boo: “moto omɔti aduake ngɔngɔ dja mbai, endolo anɔini na ekumu, tina ɛ boo adaka ehele boso ba mbai.” <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Mbai mɛɛnɛ, naimodjebaka; endolo nadoi aina bato ta madiba, bɛngɛ boo lamoenɛmɛdjae ohuu ta ibota la Isalɛlɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Yoani apa tati hee boo: «Naenɛ Mwembo otita donga busa elengɛɛ embenga ko odaa diko la nde. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Naipakamodjeba, endolo Ndjambe, ona ɔlomani boo naine bato ta madiba, atɔndɔni boo: “Ona oenɛlea wɛ Mwembo otita donga busa ko odaa diko la nde, edii yo moto oinalea bato na Mwembo Mosɛnɔke.” <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Naeni ko napi tati boo edii yo Mwana ɔ Ndjambe.»<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Batingami ba Yesu ba boso</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mat 4, 18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mal 1, 16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luk 5, 1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Ngɔngɔ dja iswi imɔti, Yoani adaka koko ena, engbanga na batingami ba nde babae. <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />Ehole ɛɛnɛ yo Yesu anoe, abala boo: «Hokeani Mwana ɔ bhata ɔ Ndjambe!» <verse eid="JHN 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Batingami babae ba Yoani baoka bibaeli bia ko bakimana Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Yesu ahombana, aenɛ boo bamokimanake, ko abahɔdja boo: «Eka ɛhombakeno nda?» Bamosɔmbɛdja boo: «Labi, okadae wɛ hɔɔ?» – Kombe ena etingodjai «Molehi». – <verse eid="JHN 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Doani ko oenɛleani.» Bea bakɛɛ ko baenɛ esika ɛdaka yo, ko banɛngɛdja na nde busa bua. Ɛdaka ehole ɛ banei ngɔngɔ dja ndanda ɛ busa. <verse eid="JHN 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Omɔti ɔ bami babae ibaoka kɔpɛ dja Yoani ko ibakimana Yesu, ɛdaka Andele, mwɛngɛ Simo Piɛlɛ. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Andele asaka boso na mwanango Simo; abala na nde boo: «Loeni Masia.» – Etingodjai «Klisto». – <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Ko akɛɛ na nde odii Yesu. Amohokea ko abala na nde boo: «Odii Simo, mwana ɔ Yoani; baobealea Sefasi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sefasi etingodjai mondeke.</char></note>.»<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abei Pilipo na Natanɛlɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Ɔya busa, Yesu adaka na mbuno ɛokɛ ta Galilai. Asaka na Pilipo ko abala na nde boo: «Kimanani!» <verse eid="JHN 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />– Pilipo adaka moto ɔ Betesaida, ibonga la Andele na Piɛlɛ. – <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Ngɔngɔ djia, Pilipo asaka na Natanaɛlɛ ko abala na nde boo: «Iso loeni hoo ɔkoma Mose tina ɛ nde ta mokanda ma mobeko ko na ona ɔbala batɛli koko. Edii Yesu, mwana ɔ Yosepu, moto ɔ Nasaleta.» <verse eid="JHN 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Natanaɛlɛ abala na nde boo: «Modjɔ mopele mohɔni oimana ta Nasaleta?» Pilipo amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Dua, ko oenɛlea wɛ mɛɛnɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Ehole ɛɛnɛ Yesu Natanaɛlɛ adoe odii yo, abala diko la nde boo: «Hokea mo Isalɛlɛ ɔ sooti; pɛpɛ modjɔ ma okosa modii ta tei ɛnde.» <verse eid="JHN 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Natanaɛlɛ ahɔdja Yesu boo: «Odjebini moda nda?» Yesu amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Boso bo Pilipo aobee ehole edaki wɛ ta itina la mole ma figi, naoeni.» <verse eid="JHN 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Bea Natanaɛlɛ amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Molehi, odii sooti Mwana ɔ Ndjambe, odii mɛɛnɛ kumu ɔ Isalɛlɛ!» <verse eid="JHN 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Yesu amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Na bea, odimeini ɛlɔkɛɛ nabali na wɛ boo ehole edaki wɛ ta itina la mole ma figi naoeni? Oenɛlea midjɔ minɛnɛ ma onɔ muu.» <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Ko abakea boo: «Edii bea, nabali nanu sooti: oenɛbini diko li dipoi ko babwɛndi ba Ndjambe baihwea ko batita diko la Mwana ɔ moto!»<verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s1">Tɛkɛ ɛ moki ta Kana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Ngɔngɔ dja maswi mabae, tɛkɛ ɛ moki ɛdaka ta Kana, ɛ Galilai. Nɛngɛ Yesu adaka ena, <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />ko Yesu na batingami ba nde babeama koko ta tɛkɛ ena ɛ moki. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Ehole esia vino, nɛngɛ Yesu abala na nde boo: «Baditi na vino.» <verse eid="JHN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Endolo Yesu amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Mama, modjɔ ma wɛ na mbai nda? Ehole ɛ mbai epakita imea.» <verse eid="JHN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Nango abala na basali boo: «Kɔɔni midjɔ misusu mibalalea yo na nu.» <verse eid="JHN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Mindungu misamano ma ndeke madaka ena imakɔmɛdjaka Bayuda tina ɛ osɛnɔdjama ba bobo. Mondungu momɔti maingiaka litele mokama. <verse eid="JHN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Yesu abala na basali boo: «Lumedjani mindungu mia na madiba.» Bamilumedja otɔɔ mɛnɛ. <verse eid="JHN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />Bea Yesu abala na bu boo: «Hadɛdi lokani maa ekenge ɔ madiba mia ko kɛɛ amapɛni moswa tɛkɛ.» Bakɔɔ oko moda mua. <verse eid="JHN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />Moswa tɛkɛ ameka madiba imahombana vino, aidjeba esika ɛdonga vino ena, endolo basali ibaloka madiba ta mindungu badjebaka. Oko ena abea moomi ɔ moki <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />ko abala na nde boo: «Bato basusu bakabange na okaana vino epele, bea, ehole ekamwɛ babeami obuke, babapi vino ɛ opɛtɛpɛtɛ. Endolo wɛ, obanei vino epele mbunoko hadɛdi!» <verse eid="JHN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Ena edii moda makɔɔ Yesu ekamodjɛli ɛ nde ɛ mbangi ta Kana, ngando ɛ Galilai. Ainedja ekumu ɛ nde, ko batingami ba nde bamodimea. <verse eid="JHN 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Ngɔngɔ djia Yesu akɛɛ ta Kapalanauma engbanga emɔti na nango, na bananango na batingami ba nde. Badaa oho maa ekenge ɔ maswi.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abengani batɛki ta Tepelo</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 21:12-13">Mat 21, 12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Mal 11, 15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-46">Luk 19, 45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Tɛkɛ ɛ Bayuda ɛ Pasika ɛimea mbuti ko Yesu akɛɛ ta Yelusalɛmɛ. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />Ta tiangando ɛ tepelo atanea batɛki ba ngɔmbɛ, bhata, na bimbenga ko na bato bakasɔmbɔtɔne falanga badii ta mesa dja bobo. <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Bea, akɔɔ pimbo na mikulu ko ababengana ibo basusu o sokolu ɛ tiangando ɛ tepelo, na bhata ba bobo na ngɔmbɛ ba bobo; ananganedja falanga dja bato ibakadjisɔmbɔtɔne, akalimodja mesa dja bobo; <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />ko abala na batɛki ba bimbenga boo: «Dongedjani leka la boono losusu haa! Pɛpɛ oimedjani ndako ɛ Tata ɔ mbai ndako ɛ ndomba!» <verse eid="JHN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />Batingami ba nde babanga olɛdja midjɔ mii imakomama boo: «Aa Ndjambe! Epaeli edii na mbai tina ɛ ndako ɛ wɛ, etumbini elengɛɛ mosa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bie 69, 10</char></note>.»<verse eid="JHN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Bea bakumu ba Bayuda babala na Yesu boo: «Embete ɛ okamoa ndani ehɔni okɔ, bɛngɛ oloinedjae boo odii na makɔki ma okɔ bea?» <verse eid="JHN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Bukani tepelo hee, ko nayeemedjalea na maswi masato.» – <verse eid="JHN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Bayuda babala na nde boo: «Tepelo hee bayepika mbua tuku inei na basamano, ko wɛ, oyemedjae na maswi masato?» <verse eid="JHN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Endolo tepelo ɛbalaka Yesu ɛdaka wɛtɛ mokuku ma nde. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Ngɔngɔ djia opusoa ba Yesu ta ndanda ɛ bago, batingami ba nde balɛdja bo abalaka bea; ko badhima Makomi na bibaeli ibabalaka Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu adjebi opele molema ma moto.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Ehole ɛdaka Yesu ta Yelusalɛmɛ, ta tɛkɛ ɛ Bayuda ɛ Pasika, bato bike badhima kombe ɛ nde ta oenɛ midjɔ ma okamwa imakɔkɔ yo. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Endolo Yesu aisapaka nabu, tin'ɛ boo adjebaka ibo basusu opele mɛɛnɛ. <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />Aikambaka boo bamodjebedjae modjɔ diko la moto tin'ɛ boo yo mɛɛnɛ adjebaka eka edii ta tei ɛ molema ma moto.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s1">Isolo la Yesu nɔbɔ Nikodɛmɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Ta ndanda ɛ Bafalusai moto omɔti adaka ena obeamaka Nikodɛmɛ, ona ɔdaka omɔti ɔ bakumu ba Bayuda. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Akɛɛ na bulu odii Yesu ko abala na nde boo: «Labi, lodjebi boo odii molehi ona ɔdonga odii Ndjambe; tingasa moto omɔti atahɔnɔ okɔ bimbete ba okamoa bakɔkɔ wɛ emiti daa boo Ndjambe adii na nde engbanga.» <verse eid="JHN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Yesu amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Sooti, nabali na wɛ boo: moto atahɔnɔ oenɛ Okumu ba Ndjambe amiti botama mbala ɛ babae.» <verse eid="JHN 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Nikodɛmɛ abala na nde boo: «Moda ndani moto ahɔni obotama naikina, ehole eimei yo mobange? Ahɔni osɔmbɔ koko ta sɔpɔ dja nango bɛngɛ abotame?» <verse eid="JHN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Yesu amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Sooti, nabali na wɛ moto amiti botama na madiba ko na Mwembo, atahɔnɔ oingea ta Okumu ba Ndjambe. <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />Ena ebotami na muni edii muni, ko ena ebotami na Mwembo edii mwembo. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />Pɛpɛ okamoa, nakabala na wɛ boo: “Otungi ɔbotame mbala ɛ babae.” <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Pueya ekakɛɛ dɔngɔ lipali yo, ko odii ooka kilingo ɛ yu. Endolo otadjeba dɔngɔ lahulake yo kaoko lakɛkɛ yo. Edii moda momɔti na ona obotami na Mwembo.» <verse eid="JHN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Na bea Nikodɛmɛ abala na nde boo: «Moda ndani modjɔ mua mohɔni okɔmɔ?» <verse eid="JHN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Yesu amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Wɛ odii molehi ɔ gala ta Isalɛlɛ; otadjebaka modjɔ muu? <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />Sooti nabalaka na wɛ boo: labalaka imadjebaka so, ko lapaka tati ɛ imaenɛ so, endolo otadhimakani tati ɛ booso. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />Otadhimeakanini ehole ɛbalaka mbai na nu midjɔ ma ngondo; moda ndani odhimaleani ekada boo nabali nanu midjɔ ma busa? <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Moto omɔti apakitaihwea ta busa, emiti daa Mwana ɔ moto ona ɔtita ta busa. <verse eid="JHN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />Oko moda maihwedja Mose ndjɔ ɔ ebende ɛ kɔngɔ ta esobe, oko moda mua Mwana ɔ moto aboani aihwedjame, <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />bɛngɛ boo moto omodhimei adihe na ndjia ɛ nde, mohelo ma kɔbili. <verse eid="JHN 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />Tina ɛ boo Ndjambe apala ngondo obuke apa Mwana ɔ nde ɔ ikinda bɛngɛ moto na moto omodhimealea atagwa endolo adihe mohelo ma kɔbili. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Tina ɛ boo Ndjambe ailoma Mwana ɔ nde ta ngondo tina ɛ oyesambedja, endolo boo ngondo ɛhele na tina ɛ nde. <verse eid="JHN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />Ona oodhimi Mwana atadiha etumbu, endolo ona oloni odhima adihi etumbu ehele, tina ɛ boo aidima kombe ɛ Mwana ɔ ikinda ɔ Ndjambe. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Ko hokeani moda ma esambi: ohuu badoa ta ngondo, ko bato bapala modidi onɔ ohuu, tina ɛ boo misala mabobo madaka mibe. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Tina ɛ boo moto mosusu ɔkɔkɔ obe adii olona ohuu ko asaswii, na bɔɔ ba boo mikɔ ma nde mibe misakaenɛmɛ ohuu. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Endolo moto ɔhelaka ta sooti adoi ta ohuu, bɛngɛ aenɛmɛ ohuu boo mikɔ ma nde makokedjame na edhimaneli ɛ Ndjambe.»<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na Yoani Mobatisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Ngɔngɔ djia, Yesu akɛɛ na batingami ba nde ta ekenge ɛ mokpɔtɔ ɛ Yuda. Adaa nabu oho, ko ainaka bato. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />Yoani koko ainaka ta Enone, mbuti na Salime, tina ɛ boo oho madiba madaka mike. Bato badoaka odii yo ko abainaka. <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />Ta ehole ena, baipaka isa Yoani ta bɔlɔkɔ. <verse eid="JHN 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Busa bomɔti batingami ba Yoani babanga oboma kitɛ na Moyuda omɔti diko la osɛnɔdjama. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Bakɛɛ atanea Yoani ko babala na nde boo: «Molehi, ɔdjebaka ona ɔdaka na wɛ ta dɔngɔ la dua la Yolodani ko ona ɔɔpa wɛ tati tina ɛ nde? Hokea ainaka ko bato basusu bakɛkɛ odii yo.» <verse eid="JHN 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Yoani abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Moto omɔti atahɔnɔ oosɔ eka, emiti pama odii yo na Ndjambe. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />Ino mɛɛnɛ odiini batemo ena ɔbalaka mbai boo: “Mbai naditi Klisto, endolo nadii ho ɔlomama boso ba nde.” <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Mwali ɔ moki adii ɔ moomi ona ɔmobala; ko mopalani ɔ moomi ɔbala adii moto ona oemi ena mbuti na nde ko amookaka, adii na sepi enɛnɛ ta ooka moholi ma moomi ɔbala, ko hadɛdi sepi ɛ mbai edii ekokake. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Eboani boo yo aihwedjame, ko ɛmbai ɛtite.»<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ona odongi ta busa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />«Ona odongi odiko adii diko la bato basusu; endolo ona odii ɔ ngondo adii ɔ ngondo ko abalaka midjɔ ma ngondo. Ona odongi odiko adii diko la bato basusu; <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />akapɛ tati ɛ mia imaenɛ yo ko imaoka yo, endolo pɛpɛ moto ɔdhimaka tati ɛ nde. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Ona oosi tati ɛ nde, adhimi boo Ndjambe akabale sooti. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Ona ɔɔloma Ndjambe abalaka bibaeli badonga odii Ndjambe, tina ɛ boo Ndjambe amolumedja na Mwembo. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Sɛngɛmoto apali Mwana ko aisa midjɔ misusu ta mabɔ ma nde. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Ona odhimi Mwana adihi mohelo ma kɔbili; ona oloni odhima Mwana adihetebi mohelo mua ma kɔbili, endolo kɛlɛ ɛ Ndjambe edabi diko la nde.»<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu nɔbɔ mwali ɔ Samalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Bafalusai baoka boo Yesu aimea na batingami bike ko ainaka onɔ Yoani. <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />– Yesu yo mɛɛnɛ ainaka, endolo batingami ba nde <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />– Ehole ɛ ooka Yesu midjɔ imabalaka bo, adonga ena ta Yuda ko asɔmbɔ ta Galilai. <verse eid="JHN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />Ta tina hee, ɛboanaka boo akatise Samalia. <verse eid="JHN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />Aimea mbuti na ibonga la Samalia, ilabeakabo Sikala, mbuti na gue ɛ Yakobo ɛɛpayo mwana ɔ nde Yosepu. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />Mombɔndɔ ma madiba ma Yakobo madaka ena. Ɔembɛ Yesu na mwɛngɔ, adaa ta mokpɛngɔ ma mombɔndɔ. Ɛdaka mbuti na ndanda ɛ busa. <verse eid="JHN 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Mwali ɔ Samalia adoa tin'oloka madiba ko Yesu abala na nde boo: «Pani madiba ma omwa.» <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />Na bea, batingami ba nde bakɛkɛ ta ibonga tina ɛ osomba mia ma oya. <verse eid="JHN 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Endolo mwali mo Samalia abala na Yesu boo: «Moda ndani wɛ, ona odii moyuda, ohɔni osɛngɛ madiba ma omwa, odii mbai, mwali ɔ Samalia!» Tina ɛ boo Bayuda, tebaokane na Basamalia. <verse eid="JHN 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Yesu amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Okɔki wɛ djeba epeeli ɛ Ndjambe ko ona ɔɔsɛngɛkɛ madiba, edii wɛ moto okɔki mosɛngɛ yo madiba ko akɔki opa wɛ madiba ima mohelo.» <verse eid="JHN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Mwali abala na nde boo: «Kumu, oditi na eka ɛ oloka madiba ko mombɔndɔ modii na mbɛngɛ. Odihalea wɛ madiba mia ma mohelo hoo? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Taatasu Yakobo alopa mombɔndɔ muu ma madiba; amwa yo mɛɛnɛ madiba ma mombɔndɔ muu, bana ba nde na meela ma nde ma tito bamamwa koko. Olɛdji onɔi Yakobo?» <verse eid="JHN 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Yesu amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Moto mosusu omwi madiba mii aokalea posa ɛ madiba naikina; <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />endolo akamwa madiba imamopalea mbai, aoketebi naikina posa ɛ madiba: madiba imamopalea mbai maimeabi odii yo elengɛɛ molo ma ediba imapɛpɛ okoka ko imakatindoe mbunoko mohelo ma kɔbili.» <verse eid="JHN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Mwali abala na nde boo: «Kumu, pani madiba mia, bɛngɛ boo nataoka posa ko natadua naikina haa aloka madiba.» <verse eid="JHN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Yesu abala na nde boo: «Kɛɛ abee muma wɛ ko sɔmbɔ haa.» <verse eid="JHN 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Mwali amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Naditi na moomi.» Ko Yesu abala na nde boo: «Obali sooti boo oditi na moomi; <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />tina ɛ boo ɔdaka na bami batano ko hoo odii nawɛ hadɛdi aditi muma wɛ. Obali sooti.» <verse eid="JHN 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Mwali abala na nde boo: «Kumu, naeni boo odii motɛli. <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Bataatasu bakumedjaka Ndjambe ta diko la ngomba hee, endolo ino Bayuda obalini boo esika ɛ okumedja Ndjambe edii Yelusalɛmɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Yesu amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Dimeani, ehole ɛduake, okɛɛtebini diko la ngomba hee kaoko ta Yelusalɛmɛ tina ɛ okumedja Tata. <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />Ino, Basamalia okakumedjaeni Ndjambe pɛpɛ omodjeba; iso Bayuda lokamokumedjae ko lokamodjebe, tina ɛ boo mohelo madoa na ndjia ɛ Bayuda. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Endolo ehole ɛduake, ko eimei ehele, ehole ɛ bakumedjɛli ba sooti bakumedjabi Tata ta mwembo ko ta sooti; tina ɛ boo edii baongɔɔneli ibakapale Tata. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />Ndjambe adii Mwembo, ko eboani na bato ibakamokumedjae bamokumedjae ta Mwembo ko ta sooti.» <verse eid="JHN 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Mwali abala na nde boo: «Nadjebaka boo Masia hoo okabeebo Klisto adoabi. Ehole edoabi yo, alotingodjabi midjɔ misusu.» <verse eid="JHN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Yesu abala na nde boo: «Nadii Masia, ona ɔbalaka na wɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Oko ta ehole ena batingami ba Yesu bahula; bakamoa ɔmoenɛbo asoola na mwali. Endolo pɛpɛ omɔti ɔ bobo ɔmohɔdja boo: «Ɛpalaka wɛ odii yo yee?» Kaoko: «Tina ɛsoolaka wɛ na nde nda?» <verse eid="JHN 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Bea mwali akina kulutu ɛ nde ɛ madiba ena ko asɔmbɔ ta ibonga, atɔndɔ bato boo: <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />«Dua aindjeni nasaki na moto omɔti ona otɔndɔini midjɔ misusu makɔɔ mbai. Adaetelea Masia?» <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Bato baimana ta ibonga ko bakɛɛ odii Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Ta ehole ena, batingami baongɔɔnɔ Yesu boo: «Labi, peta yaka!» <verse eid="JHN 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Endolo abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Nadii na mia ma oya, imadiino pɛpɛ odjeba.» <verse eid="JHN 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Na bea, batingami basahɔdjana ibo mɛɛnɛ boo: «Emolwɛi moto omɔti mia ma oya?» <verse eid="JHN 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Yesu abala na bu boo: «Mia ma mbai edii okɔ opala ba ona ɔlomani ko na okokedja elomu ɛ nde. <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />Ino mɛɛnɛ, ɔbalakani boo: “Edikai songe banei ko mbuma djibukamalea.” Endolo mbai, nabali na nu boo, hokeani gue opele: mbuma djikpeti ko ibwani na obukama! <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Ona ɔbukaka mbuma asidjai odiha iputi la nde ko adii obolea mbuma tina ɛ mohelo ma kɔbili; oko bea, ona ɔɔnaka ko ona obuka mbuma badii osepa engbanga. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Na tina hee, edii sooti indjɛ ilibali boo: “Omɔti akaone ko okina akabuke mbuma.” <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />Naolomani abuka mbuma ta gue ɛdaano pɛpɛ osala; bakina basala ena ko ino odoi abukani mbuna dja ipetola la bobo.» <verse eid="JHN 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Bato ba Samalia bike ba ibonga dia badimea Yesu tina ɛ tati ena ɛpa mwali boo: «Atɔndɔini midjɔ misusu imakɔɔ mbai.» <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Ta tina hee, ehole eimea bato ba Samalia mbuti na nde, bamongɔɔnɔ boo adikame na bu; ko Yesu adikama ena maswi mabae. <verse eid="JHN 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Bato bakina badhima, diko la midjɔ imabalaka yo mɛɛnɛ; <verse eid="JHN 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />ko babala na mwali ona boo: «Hadɛdi lodimiti etoko ta tina ɛ midjɔ imibali wɛ, endolo tina ɛ lomooki iso mɛɛnɛ, ko lodjebi boo adii sooti mɛɛnɛ Moheledja ɔ ngondo.»<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledjai mwana moomi ɔ kumu ɔ basoda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Ngɔngɔ dja maswi mabae, Yesu adonga ena ko akɛɛ ta Galilai. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />Yo mɛɛnɛ Yesu apa tati boo: «Motɛli ta dihe ekumu ta ekomi ɛ nde.» <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Endolo, ehole ɛimea yo ta Galilai, aosɔmɔ opele, na bato ba Galilai tina ɛ ibo koko bakɛɛ ta Yelusalɛmɛ ta tɛkɛ ko baenɛ misusu imakɔɔ Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 4:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Na bea, Yesu asɔmbɔ ta Kana, ngando ɛ Galilai, esika ɛhekodja yo madiba vino. Ena bea ta Kapalanauma kumu ɔ basoda ɔ gala adaka na mwana ɔ nde moomi na epeko. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Ehole ɛoka yo boo Yesu adongi ta Yuda ko aimei ta Galilai, akɛɛ amotanea ko amongɔɔnɔ boo adoe ta Kapalanauma aheledja mwana ɔ nde moomi ona ɔdaka mbuti na ogwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Yesu abala na nde boo: «Odiini na posa ɛ oenɛ bimbete na midjɔ ma okamoa, emiti daa bea, otadhimani noko osinɛɛ!» <verse eid="JHN 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Kumu ɔ basoda ɔ gala amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Kumu, dua odii mbai boso ba boo mwana ɔ mbai agwɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 4:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Yesu abala na nde boo: «Sɔmbɔ odii wɛ, mwana ɔ wɛ moomi aheli.» Kumu ona ɔ basoda adhima midjɔ mabala Yesu na nde ko asɔmbɔ. <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Oko adale na ndjia ta iyane, basali ba nde badoa asaka na nde ko babala na nde boo: «Mwana ɔ wɛ aheli!» <verse eid="JHN 4:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Abahɔdja ehole ndani ɛoka mwana ɔ nde opele, ko bamosɔmbɛdja boo: «Edaki mɔkɔ ta ehole ɛ boso ngɔngɔ dja ndanda ɛ busa, mosa momokini ta mokuku.» <verse eid="JHN 4:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Sɛngɛmoto adjeba boo ɛdaka oko ta ehole ɛbala Yesu na nde boo: «Mwana ɔ wɛ aheli.» Bea, yo na bato basusu ba ndako ɛ nde badhima Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 4:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Edii embete ɛ babae ɛokamoa ɛkɔɔ Yesu, ngɔngɔ dja ihule ta Yuda ta oimea ba nde ta Galilai.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledjai etumbɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Ngɔngɔ djia, Yesu akɛɛ ta Yelusalɛmɛ tina ɛ tɛkɛ ɛ Bayuda. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Bea, ta Yelusalɛmɛ, mbuti na edipako ɛ Bhata, ɛdaka na ediba ɛosasosa ɛbeakabo ta liebele Betezata, ɛdaka na ngbungbu itano. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />Ta ngbungbu djia, bato bike ba bigo badaka basambi: bato ba miso mago, bato bamitɛngu na bitumbɛ. [Baombaka boo madiba makumane; <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4" />tina ɛ boo obwendi ɔ Kumu atitaka bihole bikina ta ediba ɛosasosa ko akumanaka madiba. Moto ɔ ego ɔ boso ɔtitiaka ta ehole ekumani madiba, ahelaka na ego ɛ nde, noko ego ɛdae ɛ moda ndani.] <verse eid="JHN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Moto omɔti adaka ena ona ɔnɛngɛdja na epeko mbua tuku isato na mwaambe. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Ehole ɛmoenɛ Yesu asambi ko ɔɔka yo boo anɛngɛdja na epeko ehole eyai, amohɔdja boo: «Ɔpalaka ɔhele?» <verse eid="JHN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Moto ɔ epeko amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Kumu, naditi na moto ɔ otitedjani ta ediba ɛ osasosa ehole ekakumane madiba; ko okameke mbai boo nakɛɛ atitea, moto okina akatitee boso bambai.» <verse eid="JHN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Yesu abala na nde boo: «Emaa, tomba itɔkɔ la we ko dala.» <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Oko ena ambuku, moto ona ahela; atomba itɔkɔ la nde ko abanga odala. Modjɔ mua manɔkɔ ta iswi la sabata, <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />ko bakumu ba Bayuda babala na moto ona ɔhela boo: «Busabu edii sabata, obwaniti ɔtombe itɔkɔ la wɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Moto ona oohelɛdjaini abali na mbai boo: “Tomba itɔkɔ la wɛ ko dala.”» <verse eid="JHN 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Bato bia bamohɔdja boo: «Moto ona ndani obali na wɛ boo: “Tomba itɔkɔ la wɛ ko dala”?» <verse eid="JHN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Endolo moto ona ɔhela aimodjeba, tina ɛ boo Yesu adimoa ta tei ɛ bato bike ibadaka ta esika ena.<verse eid="JHN 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Ngɔngɔ dja maa ehole, Yesu asaka na nde otei ba tepelo ko abala na nde boo: «Hadɛdi oheli. Pɛpɛ okɔ koko masumu, emiti daa bea modjɔ monɔi na obe mootanealea.» <verse eid="JHN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Moto ona akɛɛ abala na bakumu ba Bayuda boo ɛdaka Yesu moto ɔmoheledja. <verse eid="JHN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Na bea, Bayuda bahombaka bakɔe Yesu obe, tina ɛ boo aheledja moto ta iswi la sabata. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Endolo Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Tata adii ehole esusu ta mosala ko mbai koko nasalaka.» <verse eid="JHN 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Ta tina ɛ ebaeli ena, bakumu ba Bayuda bahombaka na ndjia djisusu baowoe Yesu; tina ɛ boo tabuke otoko mobeko ma sabata, endolo abalaka koko boo Ndjambe adii Sango mɛɛnɛ ko asaedjɛkɛ na Ndjambe.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kpati ɛ Mwana ɔ Ndjambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: edii bea, nabali na nu, Mwana atahɔnɔ okɔ modjɔ momɔti na opala ba nde mɛɛnɛ; emiti daa mua moeni yo Sango amokɔ. Midjɔ misusu mikakɔe Sengɛmoto, Mwana akamikɔe koko. <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Sɛngɛmoto apali Mwana ko amoinedjaka midjɔ misusu mikakɔe yo mɛɛnɛ. Amoinedjabi koko mikɔ mikina iminɔi mii na onɛnɛ ko omikamoabini. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Oko moda mokaongɔdjae Sɛngɛmoto bago ko abapabi mohelo, oko moda mua momɔti Mwana akapɛ mohelo odii ona opali yo boo apɛ. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Ko Sɛngɛmoto tasambedjae moto, endolo apa odii Mwana kpati ɛ osambedja midjɔ misusu, <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />bɛngɛ boo bato basusu bakumedjae Mwana moda mokakumedjae bo Sɛngɛmoto. Ona odii pɛpɛ okumedja Mwana, atakumedja Sɛngɛmoto ona ɔmoloma.<verse eid="JHN 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />«Edii bea, nabali na nu sooti boo: ona ooki bibaeli ba mbai ko oodimi ona ɔɔlomani, adii na mohelo ma kɔbili, asambedjametebi, endolo adongi ta ogwa ko adihi mohelo. <verse eid="JHN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />Edii bea, nabali na nu sooti boo: ehole ɛdoake, esi oimea ehele, ena eokabi bago moholi ma Mwana ɔ Ndjambe ko bii ibamookabi bahelabi. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Tina ɛ boo, oko moda modii Sɛngɛmoto na mohelo ta tei ɛ nde oko moda mua apa odii Mwana boo adae na mohelo ta tei ɛ nde. <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />Ko apa odii Mwana kpati ɛ osambedja, tina ɛ boo adii Mwana ɔ moto. <verse eid="JHN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />Pɛpɛ okamoani na modjɔ mua, tina ɛ boo ehole ɛduake ena eokabi bago basusu ibakundama moholi ma nde <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />ko bapusoabi ta mibombo ma bobo. Bii ibakɔɔ opele bapusoabi tin a ɛ odiha mohelo, endolo bii ibakɔɔ obe bapusoabi tina ɛ odiha etumbu. <verse eid="JHN 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />Nitahɔnɔ okɔ modjɔ na malei ma mbai mɛɛnɛ. Nasambedjaka okimana na mua imaoka mbai, ko esambi ɛ mbai edii odjoo tina ɛ boo nitahombaka nakɔe mua mapalaka mbai, endolo mua mapalaka ona ɔlomani.»<verse eid="JHN 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tati diko la Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />Ekadaa boo napi tati tina ɛ mbai mɛɛnɛ, tati ɛ mbai edɛtelea tati ɛ sooti. <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />Endolo edii moto okina ona ɔpaka tati tina ɛ mbai ko nadjebi boo tati ɛ nde ta tina ɛ mbai edii sooti. <verse eid="JHN 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />Ino ɔlomani bato odii Yoani ko yo apa tati diko la sooti. <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Mbai natakambaka na tati ɛ moto; endolo nabalaka bea oko ta tina ɛ boo ɔheleni. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />Yoani adaka elengɛɛ moinda imokayodjaebo bɛngɛ mapɛ ohuu endolo ino ɔdhimani boo ɔsepeni maa ehole na ohuu ba mu. <verse eid="JHN 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />Tina ɛ mbai nadii na tati eenɔi tati ɛ Yoani: edii mikɔ imakɔkɔ mbai imapani Sɛngɛmoto boo nakokedjae, maenɛmɛdjaka ohuu boo Sɛngɛmoto alomani. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Ko Sɛngɛmoto ona ɔlomani apaka koko tati tina ɛ mbai. Endolo, ino ɔiokani moholi ma nde ko ɔienɛni mbanda ɛ nde. <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />Tobanyeeni bibaeli ba nde tina ɛ boo todhimeni ona ɔloma yo. <verse eid="JHN 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />Ɔikoakani Makomi opele tina ɛ ɔlɛdjakani boo odihaleani ta tei ɛ mu mohelo ma kɔbili: edii Makomi mia imadii opa tati tina ɛ mbai! <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />Endolo, olonini odoa odii mbai bɛngɛ boo ɔdiheni mohelo ma sooti.<verse eid="JHN 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />«Nitahombaka ekumu odii bato. <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />Noko bea naodjebakani: nadjebi boo ta tei ɛ bono oditini na epaeli tina ɛ Ndjambe. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />Nadoa ta kombe ɛ Tata ko olonini oosɔni. Endolo moto okina akadua ta kombe ɛ nde mɛɛnɛ, omoosɔbini! <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />Moda ndani ohɔnini odhima, ino ibakaosɛ ekumu bakina odii bakina ko ibakadae pɛpɛ ohomba ekumu ekadonge oko odii Ndjambe? <verse eid="JHN 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />Endolo pɛpɛ olɛdjani boo mbai moto oopundabini odii Tata. Edii Mose moto opundabini, ona ɔɔisano elɛndɛ. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />Ɔkɔkɔno dhimea Mose sooti, eke odimeini koko mbai, tina ɛ boo yo akoma ta tina ɛ mbai. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Endolo omiti dhimani Makomi ma nde, moda ndani odhimaleani bibaeli ba mbai?»<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu ayedjai bato koto itano</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14, 13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mal 6, 30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9, 10-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Ngɔngɔ djia, Yesu akɛɛ ta dɔngɔ ikina la ibeke ilinɔi na onɛnɛ la Galilai – ekabee bo koko ibeke ilinɔi na onɛnɛ la Tibelia. <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />Emumu ɛ bato bamokimanaka, tina ɛ boo baenɛkɛ bimbete baokamoa ibakɔmɔkɔ na nde ena ɔheledjaka yo bato ba bipeko. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Ta tina hee, Yesu ahwea ta ngomba ko adaa ena yo na batingami ba nde. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />Na bea, tɛkɛ ɛ Bayuda ɛ Pasika eimeaka mbuti. <verse eid="JHN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Yesu ahokea ko aenɛ emumu ɛ bato ɛdoe odii yo; bea ahɔdja Pilipo boo: «Ohɔniso osomba mapa bɛngɛ labapɛ oya ibo basusu hɔɔ?» <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />Abala bea tina ɛ omeka Filipo, tina ɛ boo adjebaka ehele modjɔ imahombaka yo boo akɔe. <verse eid="JHN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Pilipo amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Noko na pata dja falanga mikama mibae, lohɔnɛtelea osomba mapa boo moto na moto adihe maa ekenge mokɛkɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Okina ɔ batingami ba nde, Andele, mwɛngɛ Simo Piɛlɛ, abala na nde boo: <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />«Yɛngɛ moomi omɔti adii haa na mapa matano ma ɔlɔdje na swi babae. Endolo ena edii yee ta emumu hee ɛ bato?» <verse eid="JHN 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Yesu abala boo: «Badedjani basusu.» Ndjani djadaka djinɛnɛ ta esika ena. Na bea badaa bami mbuti na koto itano. <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Bea Yesu atomba mapa, ko ngɔngɔ dja osakoa Ndjambe, amakaana odii bato ibadaka ena. Akɔɔ moda momɔti na swi, abapa moda imapalaka bo. <verse eid="JHN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Ehole ɛgola bo, Yesu abala na batingami ba nde boo: «Tutani bikenge ibidikai, bɛngɛ boo eka emɔti etabunga.» <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Babituta ko balumedja mapole doomi na mabae na bikenge ba mapa ba ɔlɔdje bitaano ibayaka bo. <verse eid="JHN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Ɔenɛ bato embete ena ɛokamoa ɛkɔɔ Yesu, babala boo: «Moto hoo adii sooti mɛɛnɛ motɛli ɔboanaka odoa ta ngondo.» <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Yesu adjeba boo badaka na malei ma omoimedja kumu. Na bea asatswa naikina ta ngomba, tina ɛ odaa oko yo mɛɛnɛ.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu adali diko la madiba</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mat 14, 22-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mal 6, 45-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Mɔkɔmɔkɔ ɔimea mo, batingami ba Yesu batita ta ekulu ɛ ibeke inɛnɛ, <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />batitea ta bwato ko babanga okatisa ibeke inɛnɛ ta dɔngɔ la Kapalanauma. Busa basiaka odipa oko Yesu pɛpɛ obatanea. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Lungu ɛtɔmbɛdja madiba ma ibeke inɛnɛ ko mula madaka monɛnɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Batingami baduka mbuti na kilometele itano kaoko isamano, baenɛ Yesu adale diko la madiba; ena ɔbatama yo mbuti na bwato; badaa na bɔɔ. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Endolo Yesu abala na bu boo: «Pɛpɛ obangani, edii mbai!» <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Batingami bapalaka bamotitedjae ta bwato, endolo oko ena ambuku bwato basɛmɛɛ ta mokpɔtɔ esika ɛkɛkɛ bo.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bato bike bahomba Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Ngɔngɔ dja iswi imɔti, emumu ɛ bato ɛɛdikaka ta dɔngɔ ikina la ibeke inɛnɛ, baenɛ boo oko bwato bomɔti badaka ko Yesu aititea ta bu engbanga na batingami ba nde, endolo batingami bakɛɛ oko ibo mɛɛnɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Noko bea, makina mato, imadonga ta Tibelia, maimea mbuti na esika ɛyaka bato mapa ngɔngɔ dja miɔngɔnɔ ma Kumu ma osɔmbɛdja misakoa odii Ndjambe. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Ehole ɛɛnɛ emumu ɛ bato boo Yesu na batingami ba nde baidaka ena, batitea ta mato ko bakɛɛ ihombi la nde ta Kapalanauma.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu, ipa la mohelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Ehole ɛtanea bo Yesu ta dɔngɔ ikina la ibeke inɛnɛ ko babala na nde boo: «Labi, ehole eimei wɛ haa nda?» <verse eid="JHN 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Edii bea, nabali na nu sooti, otahombakanini ɛlɔkɛ boo oenini bimbete baokamoa, endolo tina ɛ boo oyakini ipa ko ogolini. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />Pɛpɛ osalani tin'ɛ mia imakabehe, endolo ɛlɔkɛɛ mia makanɛngɛdjae tina ɛ mohelo ma kɔbili. Mia mia Mwana ɔ moto aopaleani mo, tina ɛ boo Ndjambe Sɛngɛmoto aisa odii yo embete ɛ kpati.» <verse eid="JHN 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Bea bamohɔdja boo: «Eboani so okɔ yee bɛngɛ boo lakokedjae misala imaombaka Ndjambe odii so?» <verse eid="JHN 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Mosala imaombaka Ndjambe odii no, edii boo ɔdhimeeni ona ɔloma yo.» <verse eid="JHN 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Bea babala na nde boo: «Embete ɛ okamoa ndani ehɔni wɛ oloinedja bɛngɛ boo laodhimee? Mosala makɔkɔ wɛ nda? <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />Bataatasu bayaka mana ta esobe, elengɛɛ ɔbalaka Makomi boo: “Abapa ipa iladonga ta busa boo bayake.”» <verse eid="JHN 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Edii bea, nabali na nu sooti boo: editi Mose moto ɔopani ipa la busa, endolo edii Tata moto oopini ipa la sooti la busa. <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />Tina ɛ boo ipa ilidongi odii Ndjambe edii ona ootiti ta busa tina ɛ opa mohelo ta ngondo.» <verse eid="JHN 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Bea bato babala na nde boo: «Kumu, lopa maswi masusu ipa dia.»<verse eid="JHN 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Yesu abasɔmbedja boo: «Nadii ipa la mohelo. Ona odoi odii mbai aoketebi ndja ko ona ɔdhimeakani aoketebi posa ɛ omwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Endolo nabala na nu boo: oenini ko noko bea odhimitini. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Basusu ibapini Tata baduabi odii mbai ko nadumbetebi sokolu noko omɔti ona odoi odii mbai; <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />ɛlɔkɛɛ boo naidonga ta busa tina ɛ okɔ opala ba mbai, endolo tina ɛ okɔ opala ba ona ɔɔlomani. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Hokea modjɔ mokapale ona ɔlomani: edii boo natabungedja noko omɔti ɔ bia ibapani yo, endolo bɛngɛ nabaongɔdjae ta ogwa ta iswi la suka. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Edii bea, opala ba Tata bodii boo: basusu ibaeni Mwana ko bamodhimi badihe mohelo ma kɔbili ko nabaongɔdjae ta ogwa ta iswi la suka.»<verse eid="JHN 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Bayuda bakotoaka Yesu tina ɛ abala boo: «Nadii ipa iladonga ta busa.» <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Babalaka boo: «Hoo ti Yesu, mwana ɔ Yosepu? Iso ladjebaka opele sango na nango. Moda ndani ahɔni obala hadɛdi boo yo adonga ta busa?» <verse eid="JHN 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Kinani ngoto ta ndanda ɛbono. <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />Moto atahɔnɔ odoa odii mbai nga Tata ona ɔlomani amiti motuba odii mbai, ko mbai, namoongɔdjabi ta ogwa ta iswi la suka. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />Hokea moda imakomama ta mikanda ma batɛli: “Ibo basusu balehamabi na Ndjambe.” Moto na moto ona ɔɔki Sɛngɛmoto ko adimi eleho ɛnde akadoe odii mbai. <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />Pɛpɛ moto ɔenɛ Sɛngɛmoto; dongedja oko ona ɔdonga odii Ndjambe. <verse eid="JHN 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />Edii bea, nabali na nu sooti boo: ona odhimi adii na mohelo ma kɔbili. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />Nadii ipa la mohelo. <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Bataatanu bayaka mana ta esobe ko noko bea bagwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Endolo moto akaya ipa ilidongi ta busa atagwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />Nadii ipa la mohelo iladongi ta busa. Moto mosusu oyakalea ipa dia, ahelabi tina ɛ kɔbili. Ipa ilipalea mbai, edii mokuku ma mbai; naopakani lo tina ɛ mohelo ma ngondo.» <verse eid="JHN 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Ehole ɛoka Bayuda bea, babaleana boo: «Moda ndani mohɔni moto hoo olopa mokuku ma nde boo lamoyake?» <verse eid="JHN 6:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Yesu abala na bu boo: «Edii bea, nabali na nu sooti boo: omiti yakani mokuku ma Mwana ɔ moto ko omiti mwani makia ma nde, odɛteleani na mohelo ta tei ɛ bono. <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />Moto ona ɔyaaka mokuku ma mbai ko ɔmwaka makia ma mbai adihi mohelo ma kɔbili ko mbai namoongɔdjabi ta ogwa ta iswi la suka. <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />Tina ɛ boo mokuku ma mbai modii mia ma sooti, ko makia ma mbai madii emweeli ɛ sooti. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />Moto ona ɔyaaka mokuku ma mbai ko ɔmwaaka makia ma mbai adii onɛngɛdja iputo na mbai ko mbai odii yo. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />Elɛngɛɛ Sɛngɛmoto ona ɔlomani adii na mohelo ko mbai nahelaka na ndjia ɛ nde; moda momɔti, ona ɔyaakani ahelabi na ndjia ɛ mbai. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Hee edii ipa iladonga ta busa. Iditi elengɛɛ dia ilayaka bataatanu, ibagwa. Endolo ona ɔyaaka ipa dii ahelabi tina ɛ kɔbili.» <verse eid="JHN 6:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Bea Yesu aleha midjɔ mia misusu ta ndako ɛ miongɔnɔ ɛ Bayuda ta Kapalanauma.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bibaeli ba mohelo ma kɔbili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Ngɔngɔ dja ooka Yesu, batingami ba nde bike babala boo: «Bibaeli bia bidii bipipo ta obioka! Ona ohɔni obidhima nda?» <verse eid="JHN 6:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Yesu adjeba boo batingami ba nde bamokotoaka ta tina ɛ modjɔ mabala yo. Abala na bu boo: «Eotɛdjaini modjɔ mua ibaku? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Na bea, ebalabino yee ehole enɛbino Mwana ɔ moto asɔmbɛ ta esika ɛdaka yo boso? <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />Edii Mwembo imokapɛ mohelo; muni moditi na eka. Bibaeli bibali mbai na nu bidii Mwembo ko bidii mohelo. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Endolo bakina ta ndanda ɛ bono tebadhime.» Tina ɛ boo, Yesu adjebaka donga ibange bia ibalonaka omodhimea ko adjebaka ona omokababi. <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Ko abakea boo: «Hokea tina ɛbala mbai na nu boo: moto atahɔnɔ odoa odii mbai Tata amiti mopa enɔli.»<verse eid="JHN 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Donga ehole ena, batingami ba nde bike basasua na nde ko bakina odala na nde. <verse eid="JHN 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Bea, Yesu ahɔdja batingami doomi na babae boo: «Ino koko opalaka ɔkɛɛni?» <verse eid="JHN 6:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Simo Piɛlɛ amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Kumu, ohɔni so okɛɛ odii nda? Odii na bibaeli ba mohelo ma kɔbili. <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />Iso lodhimi ko lodjebi boo: wɛ odii Mosɛnɔke ɔdonga odii Ndjambe.» <verse eid="JHN 6:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Naiohɔni ino doomi na babae? Noko bea omɔti ɔ bono adii djabulu!» <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />Abalaka bea tina ɛ Yudasi, mwana ɔ Simo Isikaliote. Tina ɛ boo Yudasi, noko ɔdaka yo omɔti ɔ batingami doomi na babae, edii yo moto omokababi.<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s1">Denga la Yesu baloni omodimea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Ngɔngɔ djia, Yesu adala ta mɔɔngɔ masusu ma Galilai; aipalaka okɛ ta Yuda, tina ɛ boo bakumu ba Bayuda bahombaka bamowoe. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Tɛkɛ ɛ Bayuda ɛ Mitɔbɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tɛkɛ ɛ mitɔbɛ ɛdaka tɛkɛ ɛ Bayuda ena ɛnɛngɛdjaka eyenga emɔti, ɛkɔmɔkɔ ta ehole ɛ yanga ko ɛsakaka na tɛkɛ ɛ obuka mbuma. Badaka ibo basusu ta mitɔbɛ mia ta Yelusalɛmɛ. Ɛdaka tin'ɛ olɛdja mwɛngɔ ma bobo ta esobe (Hokea ta Lewi 23,34-36; Det 16,13)</char></note> ɛimeaka mbuti <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />ko denga la nde babala na nde boo: «Donga haa ko kɛɛ ta Yuda, bɛngɛ boo batingami ba wɛ, ibo koko, baenɛ misala makɔkɔ wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Moto ata mikɔ ta mbombi nga akapala boo adjebame. Elengɛɛ ɔkɔkɔ wɛ misala minɛnɛ, mikɔɔ boso ba bato basusu bɛngɛ bamienɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />Na bea, denga la nde mɛɛnɛ baimodhimeaka. <verse eid="JHN 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Yesu abala na bu boo: «Ehole ɛ mbai epakita imea. Tina ɛ bono, ehole esusu edii seko epele. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />Ngondo etahɔnɔ ookeani swɛ, endolo edii na swɛ na mbai, tina ɛ napaka tati boo misala ma yu midii mibe. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Ino kɛɛni ta tɛkɛ. Mbai, nakɛɛtelea ta tɛkɛ ena, tina ɛ boo ehole ɛ mbai epakitaimea.» <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Ngɔngɔ dja obala bea, adikama ta Galilai.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ta tɛkɛ ɛ mitɔbɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Endolo ehole ɛkɛɛ denga la nde ta tɛkɛ, Yesu akɛɛ koko, na mbombi, pɛpɛ osaenɛmɛdja. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Ta ehole ɛ tɛkɛ bakumu ba Bayuda bahombaka Yesu ko bahɔdjaka boo: «Odii yo hɔɔ?» <verse eid="JHN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Ta emumu, bato babalaka obuke ta tina ɛ nde. Bakina babalaka boo: «Adii moto mopele.» Bakina babalaka boo: «Ngasa, adii okosea bato.» <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Ta bɔɔ ba Bayuda pɛpɛ moto ɔbalaka ohuu, tina ɛ nde. <verse eid="JHN 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Ɔimea bo ta ndanda ɛ maswi ma tɛkɛ, Yesu akɛɛ ta tepelo ko abanga oleha. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Bayuda bakamwa ko babala boo: «Moda ndani moto hoo ɔ pɛpɛ oikoa ahɔni osipoa Makomi moda muu?» <verse eid="JHN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Eleho ɛpaka mbai edongiti odii mbai, endolo odii ona ɔɔlomani. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Ona ɔpalaka okɔ opala ba Ndjambe adjebalea kaoko eleho ɛ mbai ɛdonga odii Ndjambe kaoko edii boo nabalaka ta tina ɛ mbai mɛɛnɛ. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Moto ona ɔbalaka ta tina ɛ kombe ɛ nde mɛɛnɛ ahombaka ekumu ɛ nde mɛɛnɛ. Endolo ona ɔsalaka ta tina ɛ ekumu ɛ ona ɔmoloma akabale sooti ko okosa boditi ta tei ɛ nde. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />Mose aopani mibeko, editi bea? Endolo pɛpɛ omɔti ɔ boono okamisume. Tina ɛhombakano boo ɔwonini nda?» <verse eid="JHN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Emumu ɛ bato ɛmosɔmbɛdja boo: «Odii na mongɔli! Ona ohombaka boo aowoe nda?» <verse eid="JHN 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Yesu abasɔmbedja boo: «Tina ɛ modjɔ momɔti mokɔi mbai ino basusu okamoini. <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />Olenama epole ɛidonga odii Mose, ɛdonga odii bataatasu. Endolo Mose apa enɔli ɛ olena bana bami epole. Ta tina hee, ɔdhimakani olena epole noko ta busa ba sabata. <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Ekadaa boo ɔlenakani epole ta busa ba sabata tina ɛ osuma mobeko ma Mose, tina ɛlemoakano na mbai nakaheledja moto ta busa ba sabata nda? <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Pɛpɛ osambedjani na imaenɛkɛno sokolu, endolo sambedjani na odjoo.»<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu adii Masia?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Bakina bato ba Yelusalɛmɛ babalaka boo: «Editi moto hoo ɔhombakabo baowoe? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Hokeani: abalaka boso ba bato basusu ko pɛpɛ noko moto ɔmobaleaka eka! Bakumu ba booso basipoi opele mɛɛnɛ boo adii Masia? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Endolo moto hoo, ladjebaka esika edongi yo, ehole edoabi Masia, moto adjebetebi dɔngɔ lidongi yo.»<verse eid="JHN 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Na bea Yesu alehaka ta tepelo; abala na moholi diko boo: «Ɔdjebakanini sooti mɛɛnɛ ko na esika ɛdonga mbai? Naidoa na opala ba mbai mɛɛnɛ, endolo Moto ɔlomani adii sooti ko ino tomodjebeni. <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />Mbai, namodjebaka tina ɛ boo nadongake odii yo ko edii yo moto ɔlomani.» <verse eid="JHN 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Na bea, bahombaka bamopee, endolo moto aibakea ebɔ diko la nde, tina ɛ boo ehole ɛ nde ɛipakaimea. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Endolo ta emumu, bato bike bamodhimea. Babalaka boo: «Ehole edoabi Masia, akɔbi bimbete baokamoa onɔ moto hoo?»<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bafalusai balomi basindjili ba tepelo tina ɛ opea Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Bafalusai baoka midjɔ misusu imabalaka emumu na popoli diko la Yesu. Bea bakumu ba banganga ba Ndjambe na Bafalusai baloma basindjili ba tepelo tina ɛ omopea. <verse eid="JHN 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Yesu abala boo: «Nadii nanu maa ehole mokɛkɛ, ngɔngɔ djia nakɛlɛa odii ona ɔlomani. <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />Ohombabinini, endolo odihetebinini, esika edabi mbai, ohɔnetebini oimea.» <verse eid="JHN 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Bayuda basahɔdjanaka boo: «Esika ekɛlea yo ndani boo lotahɔnɔ omodiha? Ekɛlea yo odii Bayuda ibahelaka odii ba Gɛlɛke? Ekɛlea yo aleha ba Gɛlɛke? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Ɛpalaka yo abale na bibaeli bii: Ohombaleanini, endolo odihetebinini, tina ɛ boo ohɔnetebini oimea ta esika edabi mbai?»<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dua dja madiba ma mohelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Iswi lasuka, ladaka iswi inɛnɛ la tɛkɛ. Iswi dia, Yesu aema, abala na moholi diko boo: «Nga moto akadaa na posa ɛ madiba, adoe odii mbai ko amwɛ. <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />“Moto ona ɔdhimeakani, dua dja madiba ma mohelo djikɛlɛbi ta molema ma nde”, elengɛɛ ɔbalaka Makomi.» <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Abalaka bea diko la Mwembo imoosɔbi bato ibamodhimeabi. Ta ehole ena, Mwembo maipakaa dua, tina ɛ boo Yesu aipakaa kumedjama.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bato babɔtɔɔ tina ɛ Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Ngɔngɔ dja ooka bibaeli bia, bakina, ta emumu, babalaka boo: «Moto hoo adii sooti mɛɛnɛ Motɛli!» <verse eid="JHN 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Bakina babalaka boo: «Adii Masia!» – «Endolo, bakina basɔmbɛdjaka, Masia ahɔni odonga ta Galilai? <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Makomi mabalaka boo Masia adabi omɔti ɔ mbota ɛ Davidi donga Bɛtɛlɛmɛ, ngando ɛ Davidi.» <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Na bea emumu ɛidaka na kope emɔti tina ɛ Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Bakina ta ndanda ɛ bobo bapalaka omopea, endolo pɛpɛ moto omɔti ɔbakea ebɔ diko la nde.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Taka ɛ edhimeli ɛ bakumu ba Bayuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Basindjili ba tepelo basɔmbɔ odii bakumu ba banganga Ndjambe ko Bafalusai ibabahɔdja boo: «Tina ɛ edai no pɛpɛ ololwɛ Yesu nda?» <verse eid="JHN 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Basindjili basɔmbɛdja boo: «Pɛpɛ moto opakabala elengɛɛ yo!» – <verse eid="JHN 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />«Bafalusai babahɔdja boo: Ino koko okoseamini? <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />Odini na moto omɔti ta ndanda ɛ bakumu kaoko Bafalusai ona ɔmodhimea? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Edii oko bato iba pɛpɛ odjeba mobeko ma Mose, ibalakedjama!» <verse eid="JHN 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Nikodɛmɛ ona ɔdaka omɔti ɔ Bafalusai ɔɔkɛɛ asaka na Yesu boso. Abala na bu boo: <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />«Okimana na mobeko ma booso, lohɔniti odumba moto na ikambo pɛpɛ omooka ko pɛpɛ odjeba modjɔ mokɔi yo.» <verse eid="JHN 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />Bamosɔmbɛdja boo: «Wɛ, edii wɛ koko moto ɔ Galilai? Indja ta Makomi ko oenɛtelea noko motɛli omɔti ɔdonga ta Galilai.»</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 7:52">Yesu na mwali ɔ bɔɔli</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:52">[<verse eid="JHN 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />Ngɔngɔ djia moto na moto asɔmbɔ ta ndako ɛ nde.<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Endolo Yesu akɛɛ ta ngomba ɛ mele ma Olive. <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Ngɔngɔ dja busa bokina sɔɔ, asɔmbɔ ta tepelo ko bato basusu babatama mbuti na nde. Adaa ko abanga obaleha. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Bato ba edjebeli ɛ mibeko na Bafalusai badoa na mwali ɔtɛmbɔlɔ bo. Bamoemea boso ba bato basusu <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />ko babala na Yesu boo: «Molehi, lokundumodjai mwali hoo akɔɔ bɔɔli. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />Mose alopa enɔli ta mobeko boo laowoe bali ba moda muu na ndeke. Ko wɛ, ɔbali enao?» <verse eid="JHN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />Babalaka modjɔ mua tina ɛ omomeka, bɛngɛ boo bamopunde. Endolo Yesu asunama ko abanga okoma na mosapi ta kpɔtɔ. <verse eid="JHN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Ena ɔdakabo oko bamohɔdja, Yesu asunoa ko abala na bu boo: «Yɛɛ omɔti ɔ bono odii pɛpɛ okɔ isumu amolɛ mondeke boso.» <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Bea asunama naikina ko asɔmbɔ okoma ta kpɔtɔ. <verse eid="JHN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Ehole ɛoka bo bibaeli bia, basasua omɔti na omɔti, obanga na basuku. Yesu adika yo buki nɔbɔ mwali, ona ɔdaka ena aemi boso ba nde. <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Na bea Yesu asunoa ko abala na nde boo: «Mwali, odii bia ibaopundaki hɔɔ? Pɛpɛ moto odumbi na ikambo?» – <verse eid="JHN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Kumu, pɛpɛ moto.» Yesu abala na nde boo: «Mbai koko, naodumbiti na ikambo. Ohɔni oyana, endolo donga hadɛdi, pɛpɛ okɔ isumu.»]<verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu, ohuu ba ngondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Yesu abala na bu koko boo: «Mbai nadii ohuu ba ngondo. Ona ɔkimanakani adihabi ohuu ba mohelo ko adaletebi ta modidi.» <verse eid="JHN 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />Bafalusai babala na nde boo: «Odii osapa tati tina ɛ wɛ mɛɛnɛ; tati ɛ wɛ editi sooti.» <verse eid="JHN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Noko ekadaa boo napi tati tina ɛ mbai mɛɛnɛ, tati ɛ mbai edii sooti, tina ɛ boo nadjebaka esika ɛdonga mbai ko esika ɛkeke mbai. Endolo ino, otadjebakani dɔngɔ ladonga mbai ko lakeke mbai. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Ino okasambedjaeni na omoto; mbai tesambejae moto. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Endolo, ekadaa boo naimei osambedja, esambi ɛ mbai edii sooti, tina ɛ boo naditi mbai buki tina ɛ osambedja, endolo Tata ona ɔlomani adii na mbai engbanga. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />Ɛkomama ta mobeko ma boono boo ekadaa boo tati epami na bato babae, tati ena edii sooti. <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />Napaka tati tina ɛ mbai mɛɛnɛ ko Tata ona ɔlomani adii opa koko tati tina ɛ mbai.» <verse eid="JHN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Bafalusai bamohɔdja boo: «Odii Sangwao hɔɔ?» Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Otadjebakani na mbai na Tata. Okɔkino djebanini, eke odjebini koko Tata.» <verse eid="JHN 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Yesu abala na bu bibaeli bia ehole ɛlehaka yo ta tepelo, mbuti na esika ɛisaka bo bipeeli. Pɛpɛ moto ɔmopea, tina ɛ boo ehole ɛ nde eipaka imea.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu adjebedjai okɛ ba nde mbuti na Sango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Yesu abala na bu koko boo: «Mbai nakeke; ohombaleanini, endolo ogwaleani ta ndanda ɛ isumu la bono. Ohɔneteleani okɛ ta esika ekɛlea mbai.» <verse eid="JHN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Bea Bayuda basabaleaka boo: «Ekɛɛlea yo asaowa yo mɛɛnɛ, tin'ɛ abalaka boo: “Esika ekɛɛlea mbai, ohɔneteleani okɛ oho”?» <verse eid="JHN 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Yesu abala na bu boo: «Ino odini bato ba nase, endolo mbai nadongi odiko. Ino odini bato ba ngondo hee, endolo mbai naditi moto ɔ ngondo hee. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Edii tina ɛbala mbai na nu boo ogwaleani ta ndanda ɛ masumu ma boono. Tina ɛ boo ogwaleani ta masumu ma boono omitidhimani boo mbai “nadii ona odii”.» – <verse eid="JHN 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Bamohɔdja boo: «Wɛ odii nda?» Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Ona ɔbala mbai na nu donga ibange. <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />Nadii na midjɔ mike ma obala ko maosambɛdja diko la boono. Endolo nadjebedjaka ta ngondo oko mua imaoka mbai odii ona ɔlomani; ko yo, akabale sooti.»<verse eid="JHN 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Baidjeba boo abalaka na bu tina ɛ Sango. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Bea Yesu abala na bu boo: «Ehole eihwedjabino Mwana ɔ moto diko, odjebabini boo mbai “nadii ona odii”; odjebabini boo nitakɔkɔ modjɔ momɔti na opala ba mbai: nabalaka oko mua imalehani Tata. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Ona ɔlomani adii na mbai engbanga; aikinani mbai buki, tina ɛ boo ehole esusu nakakɔe midjɔ imikamosepedjae.» <verse eid="JHN 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Ehole ɛdaka Yesu abala bea, bato bike bamodhimea.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Basɔmi na babuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Bea Yesu abala na Bayuda ibamodhimea boo: «Ekadaa boo onɛngɛdjaini ta tei ɛ ebaeli ɛ mbai, odiini sooti mɛɛnɛ batingami ba mbai; <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />na bea odjebaleani sooti ko sooti eoimedjaleani basɔmi.» <verse eid="JHN 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Bamosɔmbɛdja boo: «Lodii mbota ɛ Abalayama ko laida noko osinɛɛ babuli ba moto. Moda ndani ohɔni obala nasu boo: “Oimeleani basɔmi”?» <verse eid="JHN 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Edii bea, nabalaka na nu sooti: moto mosusu ona odii okɔ isumu adii mobuli ɔ isumu. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Mobuli tadikame seko ta ibota, endolo mwana ɔ ibota akadikame seko. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Ekadaa boo Mwana aodongedjaini ta ibuli, odabini sooti basɔmi. <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />Nadjebi boo odiini mbota ɛ Abalayama. Endolo ɔhombakani boo ɔowonini, tina ɛ boo todhimeni bibaeli ba mbai. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />Mbai, nabalaka midjɔ imainedjani Tata, endolo ino, ɔkɔkɔni midjɔ imabala sangwanu na nu.» <verse eid="JHN 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Bamosɔmbɛdja boo: «Sangwasu, edii Abalayama.» – Yesu abala na bu boo: «Ekadaa boo odakini bana ba Abalayama, okɔki kɔɔni misala ma Abalayama. <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Endolo hadɛdi, noko nabali na nu sooti ɛikoa mbai odii Ndjambe, ɔhombakani boo ɔwonini. Abalayama aikɔ moda mua! <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />Ino, ɔkɔkɔni misala moda momɔti na sangwanu.» Ibo bamosɔmbɛdja boo: «Iso loditi bana ba bɔɔli. Lodii na Sɛngɛmoto omɔti, Ndjambe.» <verse eid="JHN 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Yesu abala na bu boo: «Ekadaa sooti boo Ndjambe adii Sangwanu, okɔkipalanini, tina ɛ boo nadonga odii Ndjambe ko nadii haa tina ɛ nde. Naidoa na opala ba mbai mɛɛnɛ, endolo edii yo moto ɔlomani. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Tina ndani otasipoakani mii imabalaka mbai? Tina ɛ boo otakini esipoli ɛ ooka bibaeli ba mbai. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />Sangwanu edii djabulu ko okapale okɔɔni oko midjɔ imikapale yo. Adii moowoi donga ibange. Aemiti ta sooti tina ɛ boo sooti editi ta tei ɛ nde. Aekelana na epulu ko epulu ena ekadonge ta molema ma nde, tina ɛ boo adii moto ɔ epulu ko sɛngɛ epulu. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Endolo mbai nabalaka sooti ko ta tina ena otadhimeakanini. <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />Ona ohɔni ta ndanda ɛ boono oinedja boo nakɔɔ isumu nda? Ko ekadaa boo nabalaka sooti, tina eloni no odhimeani nda? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />Ona odii ɔ Ndjambe akaoke bibaeli ba Ndjambe. Endolo ino oditini bato ba Ndjambe ko na tina ena tookeni.»<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na Abalayama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Bayuda basɔmbɛdja Yesu boo: «Oeni modjɔ imabalaka so odii moto ɔ Samalia ko mwembo mobe modii ta tei ɛ wɛ?» <verse eid="JHN 8:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Yesu asɔmbɛdja boo: «Naditi na mwembo mobe, endolo nakakumedjae Tata ko ino, ɔsɛtɔdjakanini. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />Te hombe ekumu tina ɛ mbai mɛɛnɛ. Edii na moto omɔti ɔyehombaka tina ɛ mbai ko ona ɔsambedjaka. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />Edii bea, nabali na nu sooti boo: Ona osumaka bibaeli ba mbai agwɛtebi.»<verse eid="JHN 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Bea Bayuda babala boo: «Hadɛdi lodjebi boo mwembo mobe modii ta tei ɛ wɛ! Abalayama agwa, batɛli bagwa, ko wɛ, obalaka boo: “Ona ɔsumaka bibaeli ba mbai atagwa noko osinɛɛ.” <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Wɛ ɔlɛdjaka boo onoi sangwasu Abalayama? Yo agwa, batɛli bagwa koko. Ɔsatombaka elengɛɛ nda?» <verse eid="JHN 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Yesu asɔmbɛdja boo: «Ekadaa boo nasakumedjaka mbai mɛɛnɛ, ekumu ɛ mbai editi na tina. Ona okakumedjaeni edii Tata. Ino, okabaleni na nde boo: “Adii Ndjambe ɔ booso”, <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />noko bea tomodjebeni. Mbai namodjebaka. Nakabala boo temodjebe, naimei moto ɔ epulu elengɛɛ ino. Endolo mbai namodjebaka ko nakasume bibaeli ba nde. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Sangwanu Abalayama, adaa na sepi ena olɛdjaka yo boo aenɛlea iswi la mbai; alienɛ ko aluma na sepi.» <verse eid="JHN 8:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Bayuda babala na Yesu boo: «Edii yee, wɛ opakita kokedja noko bianga tuku itano ko odii obala boo oenɛ Abalayama?» <verse eid="JHN 8:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Edii bea, nabali na nu sooti: boso ba boo Abalayama abotame, “nadii”.» <verse eid="JHN 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Na bea batuta ndeke bɛngɛ bamolɛ. Endolo Yesu asabomba ko aimwana ta tepelo.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledjai moto ɔbotama na miso mago</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Ehole ɛdaka Yesu adale, aenɛ moto ɔdaka na miso mago donga obotama ba nde. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Batingami ba nde bamohɔdja boo: «Molehi, tina ndani moto hoo abotama na miso mago: edii tina ɛ isumu la nde kaoko tina ɛ isumu la baboti ba nde?» <verse eid="JHN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Yesu asɔmbɛdja boo: «Editi tina ɛ isumu la nde, kaoko tina ɛ isumu la baboti ba nde. Adii na miso mago bɛngɛ boo misala ma Ndjambe maenɛme ohuu ta tei ɛ nde. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />Ehole edii moi, eboani na su okokedja misala ma ona ɔlomani. Bulu bobatami, pɛpɛ moto ohɔni osala. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />Ehole edii mbai ta ngondo, nadii ohuu ba ngondo.»<verse eid="JHN 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Ngɔngɔ dja obala bea, Yesu atɔɔ masɔi ta kpɔtɔ ko amanyɔmɔ na kpɔtɔ; ko asua masɛtɛ mia ta miso ma moto ɔ miso mago <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />ko abala na nde boo: «Kɛɛ asasose mbanda ta ediba ɛ osasosa ɛ Siloe.» Moto ɔ miso mago akɛɛ ena, asasosa boso ko, ta ihule la nde, aenɛ! <verse eid="JHN 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Bato ibadaka mbuti na nde ko ibamoenɛkɛ asɛngɛ babala boo: «Hoo titi moto ona ɔdaka adii ena asɛngɛ?» <verse eid="JHN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Bakina babalaka boo: «Edii oko yo.» Bakina koko babalaka boo: «Pɛpɛ, editi yo, endolo akoana na nde.» Ko moto ona abala boo: «Edii oko mbai.» <verse eid="JHN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Bea bamohɔdja boo: «Moda modipoi na miso ma wɛ nda?» <verse eid="JHN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Yo abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Moto ɔbeakabo Yesu anyɔmi baamasɛtɛ, amasuoini ta miso ma mbai ko abali na mbai boo: “Kɛɛ asasose boso ta Siloe.” Nakɛɛ ena ko, ngɔngɔ dja osasosa, naenɛ!» <verse eid="JHN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Bamohɔdja naikina boo: «Odii moto ona hɔɔ?» – Asɔmbɛdja boo: «Nitadjeba.»<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bafalusai bahɔdjai moto ɔ miso mago ɔɔhela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Bea bakɛɛ na moto ɔ miso mago ɔɔhela odii Bafalusai. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />Ena bea Yesu anyɔmɔ kpɔtɔ na masoi ma nde ko aheledja moto ɔ miso mago ta iswi la sabata. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Na tina hee Bafalusai, ibo koko bahɔdja moto ona moda ndani masɔmbɔ na nde oenɛ. Abala na bu boo: «Asingini baa masɛtɛ ba kpɔtɔ idjanyɔmɔ yo na masoi ma nde ta miso, nasasosi mbanda ko hadɛdi naeni.» <verse eid="JHN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Bakina Bafalusai babalaka boo: «Ona okɔi modjɔ mua ahɔniti odonga odii Ndjambe, tina ɛ boo atasumaka sabata.» Endolo bakina babalaka boo: «Moda ndani moto ɔ masumu ahɔni okɔ bimbete ba okamoa mondumba mua?» Ko babɔtɔɔ ta ndanda ɛ bobo. <verse eid="JHN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Bafalusai bahɔdja naikina moto ɔ miso mago ɔɔhela boo: «Ko wɛ, ebali wɛ diko la moto ona oodipoi miso yee?» – Asɔmbɛdja boo: «Adii motɛli.» <verse eid="JHN 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Endolo bakumu ba Bayuda baidhima boo adaka na miso mago ko asɔmbi oenɛ. Na tina hee, babea baboti ba nde <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />bɛngɛ babahɔdjae. Babahɔdja boo: «Hoo adii mwana ɔ bono mɛɛnɛ? Ɔdhimakani boo abotama miso mago? Okɔmimo enao bɛngɛ aenɛ hadɛdi? <verse eid="JHN 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Baboti ba nde basɔmbɛdja boo: Lodjebi boo adii mwana ɔ boso ko abotama na miso mago. <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />Endolo lotadjeba imonɔi bɛngɛ aimee hadɛdi oenɛ ko lotadjeba moto oheledjai miso ma nde. Mohɔdjani: aditi yɛngɛ asɔmbɛdjalea yo mɛɛnɛ!» <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Baboti ba nde babala bea tina ɛ bɔɔ ba bakumu ba Bayuda. Ɛlokɛ boo, Bayuda badhimeana ehele boo babengane ta ndako ɛ miɔngɔnɔ moto akadhima boo Yesu adii Masia. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Hokea tina ɛ ɛbala na baboti ba nde boo: «Mohɔdjani yo mɛɛnɛ, aditi yɛngɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Bafalusai babea naikina mbala ɛ babae moto ona odaka na miso mago ko babala na nde boo: «Pa Ndjambe ekumu na obala sooti. Lodjebi boo moto ona oheledjai adii moto ɔ masumu.» <verse eid="JHN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Nitadjeba kaoko adii moto ɔ masumu kaoko pɛpɛ. Endolo nadjebi oko modjɔ momɔti: Nadaki na miso mago ko hadɛdi naeni.» <verse eid="JHN 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Bamohɔdja boo: «Eokɔi yo nde? Moda moheledjai yo miso ma wɛ nda?» – <verse eid="JHN 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Asɔmbɛdja boo: «Nabalaki na nu ehele, endolo ookitini. Tina ɛ edino opala boo ɔokenini mbala ekina nda? Ino koko ɔpalaka ɔimeeni batingami ba nde?» <verse eid="JHN 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Bea Bafalusai babanga omosinga ko obala na nde boo: «Edii wɛ moto odii motingami ɔ nde! Iso, lodii batingami ba Mose. <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Ladjebaka boo Ndjambe abala na Mose; endolo yo, lotadjebaka esika ɛɛdonga yo!» <verse eid="JHN 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Moto ona abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Hokea modjɔ ma okamoa: otadjebakani ngise ɛ donga yo noko bea aheledjai miso ma mbai! <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Ladjebaka bo Ndjambe taoke bato ba masumu, endolo akaoke moto ona okamosume ko okakɔe opala ba nde. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Pɛpɛ iswi imɔti laokaso boo moto omɔti aheledjai moto ɔbotama na miso mago. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Ekada boo moto ona aidonga odii Ndjambe, atahɔno okɔ eka emɔti.» <verse eid="JHN 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />Bamosɔmbɛdja boo: «Moda ndani wɛ ona ɔbotama mosusu ta tei isumu ɔlolehee?» Na bea bamobengana sokolu ɛ ndako ɛ miongɔɔnɔ ɛ Bayuda.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bagweli miso ba sooti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Ehole ɛoka Yesu boo babengani moto ɔhela na miso mago, akɛɛ asaka na nde ko abala na nde boo: «Odhimi Mwana ɔ moto?» – <verse eid="JHN 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Kumu, adii ndani, bɛngɛ namodhime.» <verse eid="JHN 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Yesu abala na nde boo: «Na bea, omoeni; edii yo moto ɔbalaka na wɛ hadɛdi.» <verse eid="JHN 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Moto ona abala boo: «Kumu, nadhimi». Ko akwa magundɛ boso ba Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Na bea Yesu abala na nde boo: «Nadoa ta ngondo tina ɛ obɔtɔdja bato: bɛngɛ boo ibagwa miso baenɛ ko bii ibakaenɛ bagwɛ miso.» <verse eid="JHN 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Bafalusai bakina, ibadaka mbuti na nde, baoka bibaeli bia ko bamohɔdja boo: «Edii yee, ɔpalaka ɔbale boo iso koko lagwa miso?» <verse eid="JHN 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Ekadaa boo odini bato ibagwa miso, otadumbamani na ikambo; endolo hadɛdi ɔbalakano boo: “Laenɛkɛ”, okwini na ikambo.»<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s1">Indjɛ la mobanyeli mopele ɔ bhata.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />Yesu abala boo: «Edii bea, nabali na nu sooti: moto amiti ingea na ndjia ɛ edipako ɛ ikutu la bhata, endolo aihwei ta lu dɔngɔ ikina, adii moibi ko mopundji. <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Endolo ona oingei na ndjia ɛ edipako adii mobanei ɔ bhata. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />Mobanyeli ɔ ikutu amodipoi edipako, bhata baoki moholi ma nde. Abei engi bhata na kombe ɛ nde ko aimani na bu osokolu. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />Ehole ebaimanedjai yo, adali boso ba bobo ko bhata bamokimani tina ɛ boo badjebaka moholi ma nde. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Endolo tebakimane mokɛndɛli noko osinɛɛ; bakatie ohali na nde, tina ɛ boo tebadjebe moholi ma nde.» <verse eid="JHN 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Yesu abala na bu indjɛ dii, endolo bato baisipoa modjɔ imapalaka yo obala na bu.<verse eid="JHN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu, mobanyeli mopele ɔ bhata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Yesu abala koko boo: «Edii bea, nabalaka na nu sooti: nadii edipako ɛ bhata. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />Bii basusu ibadua boso ba mbai badii baibi ko bapundji, endolo bhata baibaoka. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Mbai nadii edipako. Moto ona oingei na ndjia ɛ mbai ahelalea; ahɔni oingea ko oimana, ko adihabi mia ma nde.» <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Moibi akadoe oko tina ɛ oiba, oowa ko obeedja. Mbai, nadoi bɛngɛ boo bato badihe mohelo ko bamodihe na onɔ. <verse eid="JHN 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />Nadii mobanei mopele ɔ bhata. Mobanei mopele akakabe mohelo ma nde tina ɛ bhata ba nde. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />Moto ona okasale oko tina ɛ falanga; aditi moswa bhata. Ehole eeni yo swa adoe, abasundoli ko ati. Na bea swa abapei ko ananganedjai bwela ba bhata. <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />Na tina hee, moto ona okasale etoko ta tina ɛ falanga aditi na okɛsɛli ba bhata. <verse eid="JHN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />Mbai nadii mobanei ɔ bhata mopele. Nakadjebe bhata ba mbai, ko ibo bakadjebeni, <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" />oko moda mokadjebeni Tata ko mbai nakadjebe Tata. Ko nakabaka mohelo ma mbai tina ɛ bhata ba mbai. <verse eid="JHN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />Nadii koko na bhata bakina ibadii pɛpɛ oda ba ikutu dii. Naboani koko obalondɔ; baokabi moholi ma mbai, ko baimeabi oko bwela ba bhata bomɔti na mobanyeli omɔti. <verse eid="JHN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />Tata apalakani tina ɛ boo nakabaka mohelo ma mbai, ko namodihalea naikina. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />Moto omɔti atakatoa mohelo ma mbai, endolo namokabaka na opala ba mbai mɛɛnɛ. Nadii na kpati ɛ omokaba ko nadii na kpati ɛ omotomba koko. Edii elomu ɛpani Tata. <verse eid="JHN 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Bayuda babɔtɔɔ koko diko la bibaeli bia. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Bike ta ndanda ɛ bobo babalaka boo: «Adii na mwembo mobe! Adii na kpukele! Tina ɛ mohokamedjaka na nu nda?» <verse eid="JHN 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Endolo bakina babalaka boo: «Moto oodii na mwembo mobe tabale bea. Mwembo mobe mohɔni odipoa miso ma bato bagwa miso?»<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu alonami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Ɛdaka edidi ɛ piɔ epipo ehole ɛsepaka bo obudjeama ba tepelo ta Yelusalɛmɛ. <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />Yesu adaka anɔɔnɔ ta tepelo ta mbalasani ɛ Sɔlɔmɔ. <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Na bea Bayuda babolama mbuti na nde ko babala na nde boo: «Mbunoko ehole ndani olokinalea milema diko? Ekada boo odii Masia, bala nasu ohuu.» <verse eid="JHN 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Nabala na nu ehele, endolo todhimenini. Misala imakɔkɔ mbai ta kombe ɛ Tata mapaka tati tina ɛ mbai. <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />Endolo todhimeni, tina ɛ bo oditini bhata ba mbai. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />Bhata ba mbai bakaoke moholi ma mbai; nakabadjebe ko bakakimaneni. <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />Nadii obapa mohelo ma kɔbili, babungetebi noko osinɛɛ ko pɛpɛ moto obakatoabi ta ebɔ ɛ mbai. <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />Tata ona ɔpani bhata bia anɔi bato basusu na onɛnɛ ko moto omɔti atabakatoa ta ebɔ ɛ Tata. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Mbai nɔsɔ Tata lodii omɔti.» <verse eid="JHN 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Bayuda batuta naikina ndeke bo bamolɛ. <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />Endolo Yesu abala na bu boo: «Naoinedjani misala mike mipele imadonga odii Tata. Mosala ndani ta misala mia imapalakano boo ɔwoenini na ndeke?» <verse eid="JHN 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />Bayuda bamosɔmbɛdja boo: «Lotapalaka laowoe na ndeke tina ɛ mosala mopele, endolo tina ɛ boo ɔsaolaka Ndjambe: odii oko moto ko opalaka ɔsaimedjae Ndjambe!» <verse eid="JHN 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Ɛkomama ta mobeko ma boono boo Ndjambe abala: “Odini bandjambe.” <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />Lotahɔnɔ odongedja midjɔ imakomama ta Makomi. Nga akababea, ba ndjambe bato ibalomea yo ebaeli ɛ nde. <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />Ko mbai, Tata abudjeani ko alomani ta ngondo. Moda ndani mohɔnino obala boo nasaoli Ndjambe, tina ɛ boo nabali boo nadii Mwana ɔ Ndjambe? <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />Ekadaa boo nitakɔkɔ misala ma Tata, pɛpɛ odhimeanini. <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />Endolo ekadaa boo namikɔkɔ, omiti dhimianini, dhimani noko misala mia bɛngɛ odjebeni na osusu boo Tata ahelaka ta tei ɛ mbai ko mbai ta tei ɛ Tata.» <verse eid="JHN 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Bahɔmba naikina boo bamopee, endolo asɔmɔnɔɔ na bu. <verse eid="JHN 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Yesu akɛɛ naikina ta dɔngɔ la dua ɛ Yolodani, ta esika ebanga Yoani oina bato boso mɛɛnɛ, ko anɛngɛdja ena. <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Bato bike badoa odii yo. Babalaka boo: «Yoani aikɔ noko embete emɔti ɛ okamoa, endolo misusu imabala yo tina ɛ moto hoo midii sooti.» <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Na bea, bato bike badhima Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s1">Ogwa ba Ladjalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Ta Betania ɛdaka na moto omɔti Ladjalo ona ɔdaka na epeko, adaka na bangɛnɛ ba nde Malia na Malata. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />Malia adaka mwali ona osopa malasi ta bigbota ba Kumu ko abihakoa na swee dja nde, ko ɛdaka mwanango Ladjalo moto ɔdaka na epeko. – <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Bangɛnɛ babae ba Ladjalo baloma moto abala na Yesu boo: «Kumu, moto ona okapale wɛ apekaka.» <verse eid="JHN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Ehole ɛosɔ Yesu mosise mua, abala boo: «Epeko ɛ Ladjalo emowoetelea; edii oko tina ɛ oenɛmedja ekumu ɛ Ndjambe, ko bɛngɛ Mwana ɔ Ndjambe akumedjame na yu.» <verse eid="JHN 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Yesu apalaka Malata na mwanango Malia, na Ladjalo koko. <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />Noko ena ɔoka yo boo Ladjalo apekaka, anɛngɛdja koko maswi mabae ta esika; ɛdaka yo, <verse eid="JHN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />ngɔngɔ djia, abala na batingami ba nde boo: «Lasɔmbeni ta Yuda.» <verse eid="JHN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Batingami bamosɔmbɛdja boo: «Molehi, enɔi ma ehole mokɛkɛ Bayuda bahɔmbaki baowoe na ndeke ko ɔpalaka ɔsɔmbe koko oho?» <verse eid="JHN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Busa boditi na bihole doomi na bibae? Ekadaa boo moto adali na busa, atataa mabaku tina ɛ boo adii oenɛ ohuu ba ngondo hee. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Endolo moto akadala na bulu, adii otaa mabaku, tina ɛ boo ohuu boditi ta tei ɛ nde.» <verse eid="JHN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Ngɔngɔ dja obala bea, Yesu abakia boo: «Mopalani ɔ boso Ladjalo ahwɛli hiɔ, endolo nakɛi amongɔdja.» <verse eid="JHN 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Batingami babala na nde boo: «Kumu, ekadaa boo ahwɛli hiɔ, ahelalea.» <verse eid="JHN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Ena bea Yesu abalaka tina ɛ ogwa, endolo batingami balɛdjaka boo ɛdaka hiɔ dja modjebeano. <verse eid="JHN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Na bea Yesu abala na bu ohuu boo: «Ladjalo agwi. <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />Nadii na sepi tina ɛ boo odakitini oho, tina ɛ boo modjɔ mua mopingedjalea edhimeli ɛ boono. Endolo lakɛɛni mbuti na nde.» <verse eid="JHN 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Bea Toma –, ɔbeaka bo Ipasa – abala na batingami bakina boo: «Lakɛɛni oho, iso koko, tina ɛ ogwa engbanga iso na nde!»<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu adii ipuso na mohelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Ɔimea yo, Yesu aoka boo Ladjalo apuseama ehele ta ikila maswi manei. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Betania ɛdaka mbuti na Yelusalɛmɛ mbuti na kilomɛtɛlɛ isato, <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />Bayuda bike badoa odii Malata nɔbɔ Malia tina ɛ obapingedja milema ta ogwa ba mwangwabu moomi. <verse eid="JHN 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Ehole ɛoka Malata boo Yesu aimeake, akɛɛ asaka na nde; endolo Malia adikaa adii ta ndako. <verse eid="JHN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Malata abala na Yesu boo: «Kumu, okɔki wɛ daa haa, eke mwaninga agwiti. <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Endolo noko hadɛdi, nadjebi boo Ndjambe aopalea eka esusu emohɔdjalea wɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Yesu abala na nde boo: «Mwangwao apusoalea.» <verse eid="JHN 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Malata amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Nadjebaka boo apusoamabi ta iswi la suka ehole ɛ opusoama ba bago.» <verse eid="JHN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Yesu abala na nde boo: «Mbai nadii ipuso na mohelo. Moto ona odimeakani ahelabi, noko ekadaa boo agwi; <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />ona ɔhelaka ko ɔdhimeakani agwɛtebi noko osinɛɛ. Ɔdhimaka bea?» – <verse eid="JHN 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />Maata asɔmbɛdja boo: «Edii bea, Kumu, nadhimi odii Masia, Mwana ɔ Ndjambe, ona ɔboanaka odoa ta ngondo.»<verse eid="JHN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ayei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Ngɔngɔ dja Maata obala bea, akɛɛ abea ngɛnɛ o nde Malia ko abala na nde na popoli boo: «Molehi aimei aobeaka.» <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Ehole ɛoka Malia bea, aema ko akɛɛ pɛpɛlɛ odii Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Ena bea Yesu aipetaka ingea ta ngando, endolo adaka oko ta esika ena esaka yo nɔbɔ Malata. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Bayuda ibadaka ta ndako engbanga na Malia tina ɛ omopingedja molema ɔenɛ bo boo aema pɛpɛlɛ, bamokimana. Balɛdjaka boo akɛi ta ikila tina ɛ oyea. <verse eid="JHN 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Ɔimea Malia ta esika ɛdaka Yesu; ɔmoenɛ yo, asadumba ta mako ma nde ko abala na nde boo: «Kumu, okɔki wɛ daa haa, eke mwaninga agwiti.» <verse eid="JHN 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Yesu ɔenɛ yo boo Malia ayeaka, engbanga na Bayuda ibadua na nde. Aoka ndjokwa enɛnɛ ko saya ta molema, <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />ko abahɔdja boo: «Omopuseino hɔ?» Bamosɔmbɛdja boo: «Kumu, dua aindje.» <verse eid="JHN 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Yesu ayea. <verse eid="JHN 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Na bea Bayuda babala boo: «Hokeani, moda mamopalaka yo!» <verse eid="JHN 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Endolo bakina ta ndanda ɛ bobo babalaka boo: «Yo moto ɔɔheledja miso ma moto ɔɔgwa miso, moda ndani ahɔniti osia boo Ladjalo atagwa?»<verse eid="JHN 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ladjalo asɔmbi ta mohelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Yesu, aoka koko ndjokwa enɛnɛ ta molema, akɛɛ ta ikila. Ɛdaka ikila la mondeke iladipamaka na mondeke ta eingeli ɛ lu. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Yesu abala na bu boo: «Dongedjani mondeke.» Malata, ngɛnɛ ɛ mowei, abala na nde boo: «Kumu, akɔi so, ekoki maswi manei donga okundami yo.» <verse eid="JHN 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Endolo Yesu amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Nabalakiti na wɛ? Okadhima, oenɛlea ekumu ɛ Ndjambe.» <verse eid="JHN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Na bea badongedja mondeke. Yesu akaloa miso o diko ko abala boo: «Tata, naosakoi tina ɛ boo ookini. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />Nadjebi boo okaokeni bihole bisusu, endolo nabalaka bea tina ɛ bato bii bahikini, bɛngɛ badhime boo ɔlomani.» <verse eid="JHN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Ngɔngɔ dja obala bea, agama na ngulu boo: «Ladjalo, imana!» <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Mowei aimana, mabɔ na mako madingamake na biale ba bisendja ko mbanda ehuamake na esendja. Bea Yesu abala boo: «Mololoani ko mokinani akɛɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuta ebe diko la Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26, 1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mal 14, 1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk 22, 1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Bayuda bike ibadua odii Malia ko ibaenɛ modjɔ makɔɔ Yesu, bamodhima. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Endolo bakina ta ndanda ɛ bobo bakɛɛ odii Bafalusai ko babatɔndɔɔ modjɔ imakɔɔ Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Bea bakumu ba banganga ba Ndjambe na Bafalusai babolea tibinalo eenɛnɛ ko babala boo: «Ɔkɔkɔ so enao? Tina ɛ boo moto hoo akɔkɔ bimbete bike ba okamoa! <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Lokamokina boo akɔe bea, bato basusu bamodhimealea, ko bakumu ba Baloma badoalea ko babeedjalea tepelo ɛ booso na mbota dja booso!» <verse eid="JHN 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Omɔti ɔ bobo, Kaifa, ona ɔdaka kumu monɛnɛ ɔ ba banganga ba Ndjambe, ta mbua ona, abala na bu boo: «Ino otasipoakani eka! <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Otaenɛkɛni boo enɔi na opele moto omɔti agwɛ tina ɛ bato basusu bɛa ekomi esusu ɛdae pɛpɛ obeedjama?» <verse eid="JHN 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Bea, bibaeli ba Kaifa baidonga odii yo mɛɛnɛ; endolo, elengɛɛ ɔdaka yo nganga monɛnɛ ta mbua ona, atɛlɛkɛ boo Yesu aboani ogwa tin'ɛ mbota ɛ Yuda, <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />ko editi etoko tina ɛ ekomi ena, endolo tin'ɛ oputoanedja esika emɔti bana basusu ba Ndjambe ibanangana. <verse eid="JHN 11:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Donga busa bua, bakumu ba Bayuda badimeana boo baowoe Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Ta tina ena Yesu akina osaenɛmedja koko ohuu ta ndanda ɛ Bayuda. Akee ta Efalaima ngando ɛɛdaka mbuti na esobe, ko adikama ena engbanga na batingami ba nde. <verse eid="JHN 11:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Tɛkɛ ɛ Bayuda ɛ Pasika ɛdaka mbuti, ko bato bike bakɛɛ ta Yelusalɛmɛ tina ɛ osasɛnɔdja boso ba tɛkɛ ena. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Bahombaka Yesu ko, bea baema ootei ba tepelo, basahɔdjana boo: «Ɔledjakano enao? Aduelea ta tɛkɛ kaoko pɛpɛ?» <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Bakumu ba banganga Ndjambe na Bafalusai bapa elomu boo moto akadjeba esika edii Yesu, aboani obadjebedja bɛngɛ boo bamopee.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s1">Malia asopei malasi ta mako ma Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mat 26, 6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mal 14, 3-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Maswi masamano boso ba Pasika ɛ Bayuda, Yesu akɛɛ ta Betania, esika ɛdaka Ladjalo, ona ɔpusoa yo ta ndanda ɛ bago. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Oho, bakalea mia tina ɛ Yesu. Malata atanda mesa ko Ladjalo adaka omɔti ɔ bato ibadaka na Yesu ta mesa. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Malia atomba ekenge ɛ litele ɛ molangi ma malasi ma motwuia monɛnɛ, ena ɛkɔɔmɔ na nalade esɛnɔke amasopa ta mako ma Yesu, ko amahakoa na swee djande. Ndako esusu ɛluma na so epele ɛ malasi. <verse eid="JHN 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Bea omɔti ɔ batingami ba nde, Yudasi Isikaliote – ona omokabalea – abala boo: <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />«Tina edai bo pɛpɛ otɛkɛ malasi mia na pata dja falanga mikama misato bɛngɛ ladjipɛ odii bakwali nda?» <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />Aibalaka bea ta elɔkɔ ɛ boo akɛsɛlɛkɛ na bakwali, endolo tina ɛ boo adaka moibi: ɔpeaka yo tɔmbi ɛ falanga adaka bihole bisusu adjiiba. <verse eid="JHN 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Endolo Yesu abala boo: «Mokinani ogoo! Akɔi mua tina ɛ olɛdja iswi ipusealeani bo. <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />Odiini na bakwali bihole bisusu, endolo odɛteleani na mbai bihole bisusu.»<verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuta diko la Ladjalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Emumu ɛ Bayuda ɛoka boo Yesu adii ta Betania. Baikɛ etoko ta ɛlɔkɔ ɛ Yesu, endolo koko tina ɛ oenɛ Ladjalo ona ɔpusoa Yesu ta ndanda ɛ bago. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Bea bakumu ba banganga ba Ndjambe baingea kuta ɛ owa koko Ladjalo, <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />tina ɛ boo diko la nde Bayuda bike babakina ko badhima Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aingei ta Yelusalɛmɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21, 1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mal 11, 1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19, 28-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Ngɔngɔ dja iswi imɔti, emumu ɛ bato ɛɛdua ta tɛkɛ ɛ Bayuda ɛ Pasika ɛoka boo Yesu aduake ta Yelusalɛmɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />Ibo basusu batomba maango ma mabia ko baimana ta ibonga tina ɛ osaka na nde; bagamaka boo: «Iya koko! Adjongoame ona ɔdoake ta kombe ɛ Kumu! Yɛɛ Ndjambe adjongoe kumu ɔ Isalɛlɛ!» <verse eid="JHN 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Yesu atanea mwana ɔ punda ko abakama diko la nde, okimana na moda imabalaka Makomi:<verse eid="JHN 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />«Pɛpɛ obanga, ibonga la Siona!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:15">Hokea, kumu ɔ wɛ adoi, adii diko la mwana ɔ punda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hokea Mal 11,2</char></note>.»<verse eid="JHN 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Batingami ba nde baipakasipoa midjɔ mia imakɔmɔkɔ; endolo ehole ɛkumedjama Yesu, balɛdjana boo mia misusu makomama diko la nde ko oko moda mua imaakɔ bo ta tina ɛ nde. <verse eid="JHN 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Bato basusu ibadaka engbanga na Yesu ehole ɛbea yo Ladjalo boo aimane sokolu ɛ mobombo ko ehole ɛmopusoa yo ta ndanda ɛ bago, bapa tati ɛ mia imaenɛ bo. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Na tina hee emumu ɛ bato bakɛɛ asaka na nde: baoka boo edii yo moto ɔkɔɔ embete ena ɛ okamoa. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Na bea Bafalusai basabaleana boo: «Oenini, otahɔnɔni noko okɔ eka emɔti: tina ɛ boo bato basusu babangi omokimana!»<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bakina ba Gɛlɛki bahombi Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Bakina ba Gɛlɛke badaka ta ndanda ɛ bato ibaduaka ta Yelusalɛmɛ tina ɛ okumedja Ndjambe ta ehole ɛ tɛkɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Babatama na Pilipo, ona ɔdaka ɔ ngando ɛ Betesaida ta Galilai, ko bamohɔdja boo: «Tata, lapalaka laenɛ Yesu.» <verse eid="JHN 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Pilipo akɛɛ atɔndɔ Andele, ngɔngɔ djia ibo basusu babae bakɛɛ atɔndɔ Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Ehole eimei ena eboani Mwana ɔ moto aingee ta ekumu ɛ nde. <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />Edii bea, nabali na nu sooti boo: nga mombuma ma ndongo imokwi ta kpɔtɔ momiti gwa, modikai oko mombuma momɔti. Endolo mokagwa, moboti mbuma djike. <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />Ona oopali mohelo ma nde amobungedjalea, endolo moto oolonalea mohelo ma nde ta ngondo hee amobanealea tina ɛ mohelo ma kɔbili. <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />Nga moto akapala osaleani, aboani akimaneni; bea, mosali ɔ mbai adalea koko ena ta esika edii mbai. Tata akumedjalea moto ona ɔsaleakani.»<verse eid="JHN 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abali tina ɛ ogwa ba nde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />«Hadɛdi molema ma mbai motungeami. Ɛbalaka mbai yee? Nabale boo: Tata, heledjani ta ehole hee ɛ monɔngɔ? Endolo nadoa mɛɛnɛ oko bɛngɛ naoke monɔngɔ muu. <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />Tata, kombe ɛ wɛ ɛ kumame!» Bea moholi madonga ta busa ko maokama boo: «Na yekumedja ehele ko na ye kumedjabi koko.» <verse eid="JHN 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Emumu ɛ bato ɛdaka ena ɔɔka boo moholi mua babala boo: «Ena ɛdaka ngilimo ɛ bɛi!» Bakina babalaka boo: «Obwɛndi abali na nde!» <verse eid="JHN 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Endolo Yesu abala boo: «Moholi mua mookamiti ta tina ɛ mbai endolo ta tina ɛ boono. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Edii hadɛdi esambi ɛ ngondo hee; hadɛdi adumbalea kumu ɔ ngondo hee osokolu. <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Ko, ehole eihwedjamabi mbai donga kpɔtɔ, nakolabi bato basusu odii mbai.» <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Abalaka bea, tina ɛ oinedja moda ma ogwa ba nde. <verse eid="JHN 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Emumu ɛmosɔmbɛdja boo: «Laoka ta mobeko boo Masia ahelamabi kɔbili. Na bea, moda mohɔni yo obala boo Mwana ɔ moto aboani aihwedjame nda? Odii Mwana ɔ moto nda?» <verse eid="JHN 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Yesu abala na bu boo: «Ohuu bodii ta ndanda ɛ boono tina ɛ maa ehole mokɛkɛ. Dalani ehole edino na ohuu, bɛngɛ boo modidi mosaka okundumodjani, tina ɛ boo ona ɔdalaka ta modidi tadjebe esika ɛkeke yo. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />Dhimani ohuu ehole edino na bu, bɛngɛ boo oimeeni bana ba ohuu.» Ngɔngɔ dja obala bea, Yesu akɛɛ ko asabomba ohali na bu.<verse eid="JHN 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bayuda baloni odhima Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Noko ɔkɔ yo bimbete baokamoa bike boso ba bobo, baimodhimeaka. <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />Bea, ɛkokedjama oko moda mabala motɛli Isaya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">«Kumu, ona ɔdhima eleho ɛ booso nda?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">Ona oinedja Kumu ngulu ɛ nde nda?»<verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Isaya abala koko tina edaka bato pɛpɛ ohonɔ odhima:<verse eid="JHN 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />«Ndjambe adipa miso ma bobo ko aimedjae milema ma bobo mipipo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">bɛngɛ basakaenɛ na miso ma bobo, ko owɛi ba bobo batake esipoli.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">Batahekodja milema ko mbai natabaheledja.»<verse eid="JHN 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Isaya abala bea tina ɛ boo aenɛ ekumu ɛ Yesu ko abalaka tina ɛ nde.<verse eid="JHN 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Noko bea bike ta ndanda ɛ bakumu ba Bayuda bamodimea. Endolo, ta bɔɔ ba Bafalusai, baibalaka ohuu, tina ɛ boo basaka babengana ta ndako ɛ miɔngɔnɔ ɛ Bayuda. <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />Tina ɛ boo bapalaka ekumu ɛ bato endolo titi odii Ndjambe.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Esambi na ndjia ɛ ebaeli ɛ Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Na bea Yesu abala na moholi diko boo: «Ona ɔdhimeakani, ta sooti atadhimaka mbai, endolo adhimaka koko ona ɔlomani. <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />Ona oenɛkɛni, aenɛkɛ koko ona ɔlomani. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />Mbai, nadoa ta ngondo oko elengɛɛ ohuu, bengɛ boo moto na moto ona ɔdhimeakani atanɛngɛdja ta modidi. <verse eid="JHN 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />Nga moto akaoka bibaeli ba mbai ko abisumiti, editi mbai moto omodumbalea na ikambo, tina ɛ boo nadoa aheledja ngondo endolo titi ayedumba na ikambo. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Moto ona oolonini ko adimiti bibaeli ba mbai, adii namosambedjeli ɔ nde: eleho edii mbai opa emosambedjabi ta busa ba suka. <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Na tina hee, naibala na opala ba mbai mɛɛnɛ, endolo Tata ona ɔlomani ainedjani yo mɛɛnɛ modjɔ moboani mbai obala ko olaka. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />Ko nadjebaka boo: elomu ɛ nde ekapɛ mohelo ma kɔbili. Na tina hee nadii obala midjɔ mii oko moda imatɔndɔni Tata.»<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu asosi bigbota ba batingami ba nde.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Ɛdikaka iswi imɔti boso ba tɛkɛ ɛ Bayuda ɛ Pasika. Yesu adjeba bo ehole tina ɛ nde ɛ odonga ta ngondo hee eimei bɛngɛ akɛɛ mbuti na Sango. Apalaka seko bato ba nde ibadaka ta ngondo ko abapala mbunoko suka. <verse eid="JHN 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Na bea ehole ɛdaka bo baya engbanga, djabulu aisa ta molema ma Yudasi Isikaliote, mwana ɔ Simo, ilɛi la okaba Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Yesu adjebaka boo adonga odii Ndjambe ko asɔmbɔke odii Ndjambe, ko boo Tata amopa kpati esusu. <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />Ehole ɛdaka bo baya, Yesu aemaa, adongedja esendja ɛ nde ɛ diko, ko atomba esendja ɛsananga yo ta bongo. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Ngɔngɔ djia aisa madiba ta saani ko abanga ososa bigbota ba batingami ba nde, na obihakoa na esendja ena ɛsananga yo ta bongo. <verse eid="JHN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Ɔimea ehole ɛ Simo Piɛlɛ, abala na nde boo: «Kumu, wɛ mɛɛnɛ ɔsoseni bigbota?» <verse eid="JHN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Yesu amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Imakɔkɔ mbai otamodjeba hadɛdi, endolo omodjebabi ngɔngɔ.» <verse eid="JHN 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Piɛlɛ abala na nde boo: «Pɛpɛ, ososeteleani bigbota noko osinɛɛ!» Yesu amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Nga namiti ososa bigbota, odɛtebi engbanga na mbai.» <verse eid="JHN 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Simo Piɛlɛ abala na nde boo: «Na bea, Kumu, pɛpɛ, ososani etoko bigbota ngasa, endolo, na mabɔ na molo koko!» <verse eid="JHN 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Yesu abala na nde boo: «Moto ona osasosi mokuku adii mosɛnɔke ehele. Eboani na nde asasose oko bigbota. Odiini bapuamake, endolo titi ino basusu.» <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Yesu adjebaka ona omokabalea; ta tina hee abala boo: «Oditini ino basusu basɛnɔke.»<verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Ngɔngɔ dja obasosa bigbota, Yesu alwa koko esendja ɛ nde, adaa koko ta mesa ko abala na bu boo: «Osipoini modjɔ mahulake mbai akɔɔ tina ɛ boono? <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />Ɔbeakanini “Molehi” ko “Kumu”, obalini sooti, tina ɛ boo nadii bea. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Bea ekada boo mbai ona odii Molehi na Kumu ɔ boono, naososini bigbota, ino koko oboanini osasosana bigbota. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />Naopini ekwanedjɛli bɛngɛ boo ino koko ɔkɔeni elengɛɛ moda momii mbai kɔɔ tina ɛ boono. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />Edii bea, nabali na nu sooti boo: mobuli tanɔe moswande ko molomami tanɔe moto ona oomolomi. <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Hadɛdi odjebini modjɔ mua; odabini na sepi ekadaa boo okɔini bea. <verse eid="JHN 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />Nitabalaka tina ɛ ino basusu; nadjebaka bia ibahɔɔ mbai. Endolo eboani boo ebaeli ena ɛ Makomi ɛkokedjame: “Moto ona ɔyaaka na mbai ipa esika emɔti aimei moloni ɔ mbai.” <verse eid="JHN 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />Donga hadɛdi nabali na nu, boso boo modjɔ mua makɔɔme, bɛngɛ ehole ekokedjamabi mo, ɔdhimebini boo “nadii ona odii”. <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />Edii bea, nabali na nu sooti boo: moto ndani oosi ona olomi mbai aosini koko; ko moto ndani oosini aosi ona ɔlomani.»<verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu adjebedjai bo Yudasi amokabalea</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Mat 26, 20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Mal 14, 17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Luk 22, 21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Ngɔngɔ dja bibaeli bia, Yesu asatungea obuke ta molema ko abala ohuu boo: «Edii bea, nabalaka na nu sooti boo: Omɔti ɔboono akabaleani.» <verse eid="JHN 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Batingami basahokeanaka ko basahɔdjanaka tina ɛ odjeba moto ɔbalaka na nde. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Omɔti ɔ batingami, ona ɔpalaka Yesu onɔ batingami bakina, adaka adii ta mesa mbuti na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Simo Piɛlɛ amonyitea, bɛngɛ boo ahɔdjae Yesu moto ona ɔbalaka na nde midjɔ mia. <verse eid="JHN 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Bea motingami ona ahekoa odii Yesu ko amohɔdja boo: «Kumu, ona nda?» <verse eid="JHN 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Yesu amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Nadubealea ekenge ɛ ipa ta mosua: moto ona oyepalea mbai, edii yo.» Bea Yesu atomba ekenge ɛ ipa, ayedubea ko ayepa Yudasi Isikaliote, mwana ɔ Simo. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Ehole ɛmatomba Yudasi ekenge ɛ ipa, Satana aingea odii yo. Yesu abala na nde boo: «Modjɔ imahombake wɛ boo ɔkɔe, mokɔɔ pɛpɛlɛ!» <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Pɛpɛ noko moto omɔti ɔ bii ibadaka na nde ta mesa ɔdjeba tina ɛ bala yo na nde bea. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Elengɛɛ ɔdaka Yudasi mobanyeli ɔ tɔmbi ɛ falanga, bakina bike balɛdjaka boo Yesu amoloma boo akɛɛ asomba mia makina tina ɛ tɛkɛ, kaoko akɛɛ apa epeeli odii bakwali. <verse eid="JHN 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Bea ena ɔmatomba Yudasi ekenge ɛ ipa aimana ambuku. Busa badipa.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mobeko ma yanie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Ehole ɛimana Yudasi, Yesu abala boo: «Hadɛdi ekumu ɛ Mwana ɔ moto eenɛmi ko Ndjambe akumedjamalea ta tei ɛ nde. <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />[Elengɛɛ odihalea Ndjambe ekumu ta tei ɛ Mwana,] Ndjambe koko apalea Mwana ekumu ta tei ɛ nde mɛɛnɛ ko akɔlea na pɛpɛ ekoka. <verse eid="JHN 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />Bana ba mbai, nadii na nu oko maa ehole mokɛkɛ. Ohombaleanini, endolo hadɛdi nabalaka na nu modjɔ imabala mbai na Bayuda boo: Otahɔnɔni okɛ ta esika ɛkeke mbai. <verse eid="JHN 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />Naopakani mobeko ma yeenie: palanani. Eboani boo ɔpalaneni moda maɔpalani mbai. <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Nga okapalanani, bato basusu badjebalea boo odiini batingami ba mbai.»<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu adjebedjai boo Piɛlɛ amoinganalea</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat 26, 31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mal 14, 27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22, 31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Simo Piɛlɛ ahɔdja Yesu boo: «Kumu, ɔkeke wɛ hɔɔ?» Yesu amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Esika ɛkeke mbai otahɔnɔ okimanani hadɛdi, endolo okimanabini ngɔngɔ.» <verse eid="JHN 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Piɛlɛ abala na nde boo: «Kumu, nitahɔnɔ okimana hadɛdi tina nda? Nadii mbuti na okaba mohelo ma mbai tina ɛ wɛ!» <verse eid="JHN 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Yesu amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Odii mbuti mɛɛnɛ okaba mohelo ma wɛ tina ɛ mbai? Edii bea, nabalaka na wɛ sooti boo: Oinganaleani mbala isato boso boo kɔkɔ akɔkɔle.»<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu adii ndjia ɛ okɛ odii Tata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />«Yesu abala na batingami ba nde boo: Yɛɛ boo milema ma boono madae pɛpɛ osatungea. Dhimani Ndjambe ko dhimani koko mbai. <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />Ta ndako ɛ Tata bisika baodaa bidii bike; emiti daa bea eke nabalaki na nu boo nakɛlea aobɔngɛdjani esika? <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />Ngɔngɔ dja okɛ ba mbai aobɔngɛdjani esika, nasɔmbɔlea aotombani, bɛngɛ boo ino koko ɔdaeni ta esika edii mbai. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Ɔdjebakani ndjia ɛ esika ɛkeke mbai.» <verse eid="JHN 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Toma abala na nde boo: «Kumu, lotadjebaka esika ɛkeke wɛ. Moda mohɔni na su odjeba ndjia nda?» <verse eid="JHN 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Yesu amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Mbai nadii ndjia, sooti ko mohelo. Pɛpɛ moto ohɔni okɛ odii Tata amiti nɔɔ na ndjia ɛ mbai. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />Okadjebanini, odjebaleani koko Tata. Ko donga hadɛdi ɔmodjebakani ko ɔmoenɛni.» <verse eid="JHN 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Pilipo abala na nde boo: «Kumu, loinedja Tata ko mua mokoki na su.» <verse eid="JHN 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Yesu abala na nde boo: «Pilipo, ehole eyai edai mbai na nu, opakitadjebani oko? Ona oenini, aeni Tata. Bea tina ndani obali boo: “Loinedja Tata”? <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />Otadhimaka boo mbai nadii ta tei ɛ Tata ko Tata adii ta tei ɛ mbai? Bibaeli babalaka mbai na nu bitadongaka odii mbai. Edii Tata ona oodii ta tei ɛ mbai, akokedjaka mikɔ ma nde. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Dhimeanini ehole ɛbalaka mbai boo: nadii ta tei ɛ Tata, ko Tata ta tei ɛ mbai. Emiti daa bea, dhimani noko ta tina ɛ mikɔ ma mbai. <verse eid="JHN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />Edii bea, nabali na nu sooti boo: ona odhimini, yo koko akɔbi mikɔ imakɔkɔ mbai. Amikɔbi onɔ mii imakɔkɔ mbai, tina ɛ boo nakeke odii Tata. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Midjɔ misusu mihɔdjabino ta kombe ɛ mbai namikɔbi, bɛngɛ boo Mwana ainidjae ekumu ɛ Tata. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Okahɔdjani eka ta kombe ɛ mbai, nayekɔbi.»<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbuno ɛ oloma Mwembo Mosɛnɔke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />Nga okapalanini, osumaleani mibeko ma mbai. <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />Nahɔdjabi Tata boo aopɛni mokɔmedjɛli okina boo adae na nu kɔbili: <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />edii Mwembo ma sooti. Ngondo etahɔnɔ omoosɔ, tina ɛ boo tebamoenɛ ko tebamodjebe. Endolo ino, omodjebini, tina ɛ boo adii na nu ko adabi ta ndanda ɛ bono. <verse eid="JHN 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />Naokinetebini malike; nasɔmbɔbi odii no. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />Ngɔngɔ dja maa ehole mokɛkɛ ngondo enɛteleani, endolo ino, oenɛbinini, tina ɛ boo nahelaka ko ino ohelabini koko <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Ta busa bua, odjebabini boo nɔsɔ Tata lodii omɔti, elengɛɛ ino na mbai ko mbai na nu.<verse eid="JHN 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />«Moto oobanei mibeko ma mbai ko akamisume, edii yo moto okapaleni. Tata apalabi moto okapaleni; namopalabi koko yo ko nasaenɛmɛdjabi na nde.» <verse eid="JHN 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Yuda titi Yudasi Isikaliote abala na nde boo: «Kumu, moda ndani oboani osaenɛmɛdja na su ko endolo titi odii bato ba ngondo?» <verse eid="JHN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Yesu amosɔmbɛdja boo: Moto akapalani, asumabi bibaeli ba mbai. Tata amopalabi; loduabi odii yo, nɔsɔ Tata ko lodabi ta tei ɛ nde. <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />Moto ona ɔlonakani tasume bibaeli ba mbai. Bileho bii baokakano bitadongaka odii mbai, endolo odii Tata ona ɔɔlomani. <verse eid="JHN 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />Nabala na nu midjɔ mia ehole ɛdaka mbai engbanga na nu. <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />Tata aolomaleani Mwembo Mosɛnɔke ta kombe ɛ mbai tina ɛ okɔmɛdjani, aolehaleani ko aolɛdjanaleani midjɔ misusu imabala mbai na nu.<verse eid="JHN 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />«Naokineini ogoo, naopini ogoo ba mbai. Naopitini bo moda mokapɛ ngondo. Yɛɛ milema ma boono madae pɛpɛ osatungea, pɛpɛ odani na bɔɔ. <verse eid="JHN 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />Ɔɔkanini nabala boo: “Nakɛi, endolo nasɔmbɔlea odii no.” Okapalanini, sepani tina ɛ odjeba boo nasɔmbi mbuti na Tata, tina ɛ boo Tata anɔini. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />Nabali na nu hadɛdi boso ba boo midjɔ mia maenɛme, bɛngɛ boo ehole eimeabi mo ɔdhimeni. <verse eid="JHN 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />Nawetelea bala koko na nu, tina ɛ boo kumu ɔ ngondo hee adoi. Aditi na kpati diko la mbai, <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />endolo eboani ngondo ɛdjebe boo napali Tata ko nakɔkɔ oko moda imalomani yo. Emani, ladonge haa!»<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu, mole ma vino ɛ sooti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />«Mbai nadii mole ma vino ɛ sooti ko Tata adii moswa gue. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />Etape esusu edii ta tei ɛ mbai edii pɛpɛ obota mbuma, ayedongedjai, ko abɔngɛdjai etape esusu ɛbotaka mbuma, bɛngɛ ɛbote koko mbuma djike. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />Ino osɛnɔdjamani ehele tina ɛ ebaeli ɛopani mbai. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Nɛngɛdjani ta tei ɛ mbai, ko mbai nanɛngɛdjalea ta tei ɛ bono. Etape etahɔnɔ obota mbuma yo mɛɛnɛ, emiti tingama ta mole ma vino; na bea, otahɔnɔni obota mbuma omiti nɛngɛdjani ta tei ɛ mbai. <verse eid="JHN 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />Nadii mole ma vino, ino odiini bitape. Moto ona onɛngɛdjai odii mbai ko ona odii mbai onɛngɛdja odii yo, akabote mbuma djike, tina ɛ boo emiti daa na mbai otahɔnɔni okɔ eka emɔti. <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />Ona odii pɛpɛ onɛngɛdja ta tei ɛ mbai adumbami osokolu, elengɛɛ etape ɛ mole, ko ekakani; bitape ibikakanu, bakabitute, bakabimae ta mosa ko bikayoe. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Okanɛngɛdjani ta tei ɛ mbai ko bibaeli ba mbai bikanɛngɛdja ta tei ɛ bono, sɛngɛni eka ɛpalakano ko oyedihabini. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />Tata akumamalea: okabotani mbuma djike, na njia ena oenɛmɛleani boo odiini batingami ba mbai. <verse eid="JHN 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />Elengɛɛ ɔpalani Tata mbai koko naopalani. Na bea nɛngɛdjani ta epaeli ɛ mbai. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />Okasumani mibeko ma mbai, oyeyoaleani ta epaeli ɛ mbai, elengɛɛ odii mbai osuma mibeko ma Tata ko nakanɛngɛdjae ta epaeli ɛ nde.»<verse eid="JHN 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />«Nabali na nu bea bɛngɛ boo sepi ɛ mbai ɛdae ta tei ɛ boono ko sepi ɛ boono ɛdae na osusu. <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />Hokeani mobeko ma mbai: Palanani elengɛɛ okaopaleni mbai. <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Pɛpɛ epaeli enɔi boo moto akabe mohelo ma nde tina ɛ baminande. <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />Odiini bamina mbai okakɔɔni midjɔ maolomakani mbai. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />Nataobeakani babuli, tina ɛ boo mobuli tadjebe modjɔ mokakɔe moswa nde. Naobeakani bamina mbai, tina ɛ boo naodjebedjani midjɔ misusu maikoa mbai odii Tata. <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Editi ino bato ibahɔni, edii mbai moto ɔɔhɔni; naolomani boo ɔkɛɛni, abota mbuma ko mbuma idjikanɛngɛdjae. Bea, Tata aopabini midjɔ misusu imihɔdjabino ta kombe ɛ mbai. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Hokeani mobeko ma mbai, palanani ta tei ɛ boono.»<verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngondo eini Yesu na batingami ba nde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />«Nga ngondo ekaolonani, djebani boo ɛlonani boso ba boono. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Okɔkino daa bato ba ngondo, eke ngondo eopalini; tina ɛ boo okɔki daani bato yu. Ngondo eolonini tina ɛ boo naohɔɔni ko naoimanedjani sokolu ɛ ngondo ko oditini bato ba ngondo. <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />Lɛdjani modjɔ imabala mbai na nu: “Mobuli tanoe moswa nde.” Ekadaa boo bato banyɔkɔlɔni, baonyɔkɔlɔbini koko; ekadaa basumi bileho ba mbai, basumabi koko ba bono. <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Endolo baokɔbini midjɔ mia misusu tina ɛ kombe ɛ mbai, tina ɛ boo tebadjebe ona ɔlomani. <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />Okɔkɔ mbai daa pɛpɛ odoa ko ɔkɔkɔ mbai daa pɛpɛ obala na bu, eke baditi na isumu. Endolo hadɛdi batayɛɛmɛ ta isumu la bobo. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />Ona odii na swɛ ɛ mbai, adii koko na swɛ ɛ Tata. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />Ɔkɔkɔ mbai daa pɛpɛ okɔ ta ndanda ɛ bobo mikɔ imikadae moto okina pɛpɛ okɔ eke baikwa ta isumu. Noko bea, hadɛdi, baenɛ mikɔ ma mbai ko baokini swɛ, na Tata koko. <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Endolo ɛkɔmɔ bea bɛngɛ boo midjɔ imakomama ta mobeko ma bobo makokedjame: “Baokani swɛ pɛpɛ tina.”»<verse eid="JHN 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />«Ehole edoabi Mokɔmɛdjɛli: edii Mwembo ma sooti imodongalea odii Tata. Naolomeabini mo ko mopabi tati ta tina ɛ mbai. <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Ko ino koko opabini tati ɛ mbai, tina ɛ boo ɔdaani engbanga na mbai donga ibange.»<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />«Nabala na nu bea bɛngɛ boo osakaa bungedjani edhimeli. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />Baobenganabini ta ndako dja miongɔɔnɔ dja Bayuda. Ehole eduake bato ibaowabini, balɛdjabi boo basaleaka Ndjambe. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Bakɔbi bea tina ɛ boo baidjeba noko na Tata, na mbai. <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />Endolo nabala na nu bea bɛngɛ boo, ehole ena ekaimea, ɔlɛdjɛbini boo nabalaka na nu.»</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 16:4">Mosala ma Mwembo Mosɛnɔke</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:4">«Naibala na nu modjɔ mua donga ibange, tina ɛ boo nadaka na nu engbanga. <verse eid="JHN 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />Hadɛdi, nakei mbuti na ona ɔlomani ko pɛpɛ omɔti ta ndanda ɛ boono ɔhɔdjakani boo: “Ɔkeke wɛ hɔɔ?” <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Endolo milema ma boono milumi na ndjokwa ɛlɔkɛɛ boo nabali na nu bea. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Noko bea, nabali na nu sooti boo: enɔi na opele tina ɛ boono boo nakɛɛ; nga namiti kɛ, Mokɔmɛdjɛli adoetebi odii no. Endolo nga nakakɛ naolomealeani yo. <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />Ko ehole edoabi yo, ainedjabi bato ba ngondo ibunga la bobo diko la isumu, diko la odjoo ko diko la esambi ɛ Ndjambe. <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />Ta modjɔ ma isumu, edii tina ɛ boo: batadimeakani, <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />ta modjɔ ma odjoo, edii tina ɛ boo: nakeke mbuti na Tata ko oenɛteleanini; <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />ta modjɔ ma esambi, edii tina ɛ boo: kumu ɔ ngondo hee asambedjami ehele.»<verse eid="JHN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />«Nadii koko na midjɔ mike ma obala na nu, endolo otahɔnɔni omisipoa hadɛdi. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Ehole edoabi Mwembo ma sooti, aolɔndɔbini ta sooti esusu. Tina ɛ boo abaletebi ta kombe ɛ nde mɛɛnɛ, endolo abalabi misusu imaokayo ko aotɔndɔbini midjɔ imaduake. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />Ainedjabi ekumu ɛ mbai, tina ɛ boo atombabi midjɔ imidongi odii mbai ko aotɔndɔbini mo. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Misusu imipeli Tata midii koko ma mbai. Ta tina hee nabali na nu boo Mwembo atombabi midjɔ misusu imidi odii mbai ko amiotɔndɔbini.»<verse eid="JHN 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngɔngɔ dja ndjokwa sepi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />«Edikai maa ehole mokɛkɛ oenɛteleanini, ko ngɔngɔ dja maa ehole mokɛkɛ oenɛleanini.» <verse eid="JHN 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Na bea bakina batingami ba nde basabaleana boo: «Ɛtingodjaka modjɔ mua yee? Abali na su boo: “Edikai maa ehole mokɛkɛ oenɛteleanini, ko ngɔngɔ dja maa ehole mokɛkɛ oenɛleanini”, na koko boo: “Nakeke odii Tata”. <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />Ɛtingodjaka “ehole ekɛkɛ” ena ɛbalaka yo yee? Lotasipoaka modjɔ mapalaka yo abale.» <verse eid="JHN 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Ɔdjeba yo boo bapalaka bamohɔdjae, Yesu abala na bu boo: «Nabali na nu: “Edikai maa ehole mokɛkɛ oenɛteleanini, ko ngɔngɔ dja maa ehole mokɛkɛ oenɛleanini.” Ɔsahɔdjakani mahɔdja oko diko la modjɔ mua? <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Edii bea, nabali na nu sooti boo: oyealeani ko odaleani ta kɔndɔ, endolo bato ba ngondo basepalea; odaleani na ndjokwa, endolo ndjokwa ɛ boono ehombanalea sepi. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />Mwali akapala abote, adii na monɔngɔ tina ɛ boo ehole ɛ nde ɛ saya eimei; endolo mwana akabotama, abosai saya ɛ nde tina ɛ sepi ɛ mwana ona obotami ta ngondo. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Moda momɔti na nu, odiini na ndjokwa hadɛdi; endolo ehole eonɛleani mbai koko, milema ma boono misepalea, ko sepi ɛ boono, moto atahɔnɔ oyekatoa.»<verse eid="JHN 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />«Ta busa bua, ohɔdjaetebinini noko modjɔ momɔti. Edii bea, nabali nanu sooti boo: Tata aopaleani losusu ilomosɛngɛlea no ta kombe ɛ mbai. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Mbunoko hadɛdi, opakita sɛngɛni noko modjɔ momɔti ta kombe ɛ mbai. Sɛngɛni ko odihaleani, bea sepi ɛ boono edalea na osusu.»<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu, molongi ɔ ngondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />«Nabala na nu midjɔ misusu na mandjɛ. Ehole ɛduake nabaletebi na nu bea, endolo ta ehole ena naotɔndɔbini ohuu midjɔ imitingi na Tata. <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />Ta busa bua, osɛngɛbini ta kombe ɛ mbai; nabaliti na nu boo naongɔɔnɔbi Tata tina ɛ boono, <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />tina ɛ boo Tata yo mɛɛnɛ akaopaleni. Akaopaleni tina ɛ boo okapalenini ko okadhimeni boo nadonga odii Ndjambe. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />Nadɔnga odii Tata ko nadoa ta ngondo. Hadɛdi nadongi ta ngondo ko nasɔmbi mbuti na Tata.» <verse eid="JHN 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Na bea batingami ba nde babala na nde boo: «Hokea hadɛdi, obali na su ohuu, okini mandjɛ. <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Lodjebi hadɛdi boo okadjebe midjɔ misusu ko toombe boo moto aohɔdjae. Na tina hee lodhimi boo ɔdonga odii Ndjambe.» <verse eid="JHN 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Odhimini hadɛdi? <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />Ehole ɛdoake ko eimei ehele, onanganaleani, moto na moto asɔmbɔlea odii yo ko okinaleanini mbai buki. Endolo naditi mbai buki, tina ɛ boo Tata adii engbanga na mbai. <verse eid="JHN 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />Nabala na nu midjɔ mia misusu bɛngɛ boo odaeni na ogoo ta tei ɛ mbai. Onɔngɔbini ta ngondo. Endolo pingani! Nalongi ngondo!»<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu aongɔɔni tina ɛ batingami ba nde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Ngɔngɔ dja obala bea, Yesu angangodja miso o diko ko aongɔɔnɔ boo: Tata, ehole eimei. Enɛmɛdja ekumu ɛ Mwana ɔ wɛ, bɛngɛ boo Mwana aenɛmɛdjae koko ekumu ɛ wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />Ɔmopa kpati diko la bato basusu, bɛngɛ boo apɛ mohelo ma kɔbili odii bia ibamopa wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />Na bea, mohelo ma kɔbili modii boo baodjebe, wɛ ona odii oko wɛ mbuki Ndjambe ɔ sooti, ko badjebe Yesu Klisto ona ɔloma wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />Naenɛmɛdja ekumu ɛ wɛ ta ngondo; nakokedjai mosala imapani wɛ boo nasale. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />Ko hadɛdi, Tata, pani ekumu ena ɛdaka na mbai mbuti na wɛ boso boo ngondo ɛyoame. <verse eid="JHN 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />Naenɛmɛdja kombe ɛ wɛ odii bato ibatomba wɛ ta ngondo bɛngɛ ɔbapɛni. Badaka bato ba wɛ, ko ɔbapani, ko basuma ebaeli ɛ wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />Hadɛdi badjebi boo midjɔ misusu mapani wɛ madonga odii wɛ, <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />tina ɛ boo nabapi bibaeli ibapani wɛ, ko babiosi. Badjebi boo nadonga sooti mɛɛnɛ odii wɛ ko badhimi boo wɛ ɔlomani.<verse eid="JHN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />Naongɔɔnɔkɔ tina ɛ bobo. Nitaongɔɔnɔkɔ tina ɛ ngondo, endolo tina ɛ bii ibapani wɛ, tina ɛ boo badii bato ba wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />Bato basusu ba mbai badii ba wɛ, ko bato basusu ba wɛ badii ba mbai ko ekumu ɛ mbai ɛenɛmɛ ta tei ɛ bobo. <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Pɛpɛ ekoka nadɛtelea ta ngondo, endolo ibo badii ta ngondo; mbai nadoi odii wɛ. Tata mosɛnɔke, babanea ta kombe ɛ wɛ, kombe ena ɛpani wɛ bɛngɛ boo badae omɔti elengɛɛ mbai nɔsɔ wɛ odiso omɔti. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />Ehole ɛdaka mbai na bu, nababanyea na kpati ɛ kombe ɛ wɛ, kombe ena ɛpani wɛ. Nababanyea ko omɔti ɔ bobo aibunga, dongedja oko ona ɔboanaka osabungedja, bɛngɛ boo Ikomi lakokedjame. <verse eid="JHN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />Ko hadɛdi nadoi odii wɛ. Nabalaka bea ta ehole hee edii mbai oko ta ngondo bɛngɛ boo badihe ta ndanda ɛ bobo mɛɛnɛ sepi ɛ mbai, sepi na osusu. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />Mbai nabapi ebaeli ɛ wɛ, ko ngondo ebaokei swɛ, tina ɛ boo baditi bato ba ngondo, elengɛɛ mbai odii mbai pɛpɛ odaa moto ɔ ngondo. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />Nitaongɔɔnɔkɔ boo ɔbadongedjae ta ngondo, endolo obabanie odii Satana. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Baditi bato ba ngondo, elengɛɛ mbai naditi moto ɔ ngondo. <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />Kɔɔ boo badae bato ba wɛ na osusu na ndjia ɛ sooti; ebaeli ɛ wɛ edii sooti. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />Nabalomi ta ngondo oko elengɛɛ ɔlomani wɛ ta ngondo. <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />Nasakabi na osusu odii wɛ tina ɛ bobo, bɛngɛ ibo babudjeame koko ndjia ɛ sooti.<verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />«Nitaongɔɔnɔkɔ etoko ta tina ɛ bobo, endolo koko ta tina ɛ bia ibadimeabini na ndjia ɛ bileho ba bobo. <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />Naongɔɔnɔkɔ bɛngɛ boo ibo basusu badae omɔti. Tata, badae omɔti moda modii mbai nɔsɔ wɛ omɔti. Badae omɔti bɛngɛ ngondo ɛdhime boo ɔlomani. <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />Nabapi ekumu ɛpani wɛ, bɛngɛ badae omɔti elengɛɛ odii mbai omɔti nɔsɔ wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />Nahelaka ta tei ɛ bobo, wɛ ɔhelaka ta tei ɛ mbai; na ndjia ena badalea omɔti na osusu, bɛngɛ ngondo ɛdjebe boo ɔlomani ko boo okabapale elengɛɛ okapaleni wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />Tata, ɔbapani, ko napalaka boo nadae na bu esika ena edii mbai, bɛngɛ boo baenɛ ekumu ɛ mbai, ekumu ɛpani wɛ, tina ɛ boo ɔpalani boso ba oyoa ngondo. <verse eid="JHN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />Tata ɔ odjoo, bato ba ngondo baiodjeba, endolo mbai naodjeba ko bato bii badjeba boo ɔlomani. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />Naabadjebedja kombe ɛ wɛ ko nayedjebedjabi koko odii bo, bɛngɛ boo epaeli ekapaleni wɛ ɛdae odii bo ko boo mbai mɛɛnɛ nadae ta tei ɛ bobo.»<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s1">Opeama ba Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26, 47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mal 14, 43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22, 47-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Ngɔngɔ dja bibaeli bia, Yesu akɛɛ engbanga na batingami ba nde ta dɔngɔ ikina la mokoko ma Sedolone. Gue ɛdaka ena ɛingea yo engbanga na batingami ba nde. <verse eid="JHN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Bea Yudasi, ona ɔmokabalea, adjebaka opele mɛɛnɛ esika ena, tina ɛ boo Yesu na batingami ba nde badoaka ena mbala djike. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Yudasi, akɛɛ ta gue na elutulutu ɛ basoda na ba sindjili ba tepelo ibamopa bakumu ba banganga ba Ndjambe na Bafalusai; baimea ena na milodja, na miinda ko na bipeko ba bila. <verse eid="JHN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Yesu adjebaka midjɔ misusu imikɔmɔlea na nde, asabatea mbuti na bu ko abahɔdja boo: «Ɔhombakeno nda?» <verse eid="JHN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />Bamosɔmbɛdja boo: «Yesu ɔ Nasaleta.» Yesu abala na bu boo: «Edii mbai.» Ko Yudasi, omokabi ɔ nde, adaka na bu engbanga. <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Ehole ɛbala Yesu na bu boo: «Edii mbai», basɔmbɔ ngɔngɔ ko bakwa ta kpɔtɔ. <verse eid="JHN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Yesu abahɔdja mbala ekina boo: «Ɔhombakeno nda?» Ko babala na nde boo: «Yesu ɔ Nasaleta.» <verse eid="JHN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Yesu abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Nabali na nu ehele boo, edii mbai. Ekadaa boo ɔhombakanini, kinani bii bakina bakɛɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />Ɛkɔɔmi bea tina ɛ okokedja ebaeli ena ɛbala yo: «Naibungedja noko omɔti ɔ bato ibapani wɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Simo Piɛlɛ adaka na mopata; amoihwa ta igbogbo, aboma mosali ɔ nganga monɛnɛ ɔ Ndjambe ko amokɛsɛ itoi la ebɔ ɛ bami. Kombe ɛ mosali ona Malakusu. <verse eid="JHN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Endolo Yesu abala na Piɛlɛ boo: «Sɔmbɛdja mopata ma wɛ ta igbogbo. Olɛdji boo namwɛtelea kɔbɔ ɛ saya eepini Tata?»<verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bakɛi na Yesu boso ba Ana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Bea elutulutu ɛ basoda engbanga na kumu ɔ bobo na basindjili ba bakumu ba Bayuda bapea Yesu ko bamonanga mbɔti. <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />Bakɛɛ na nde boso mɛɛnɛ odii Ana. Moto hoo adaka okio ba Kaifa ona ɔdaka nganga monɛnɛ ta mbua ona. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Ena bea, edii Kaifa moto ona ɔleha Bayuda boo: «Edii opele boo moto omɔti agwɛ tina ɛ bato basusu.»<verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Piɛlɛ aingani Yesu mbala ɛ boso</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 26:69-70">Mat 26, 69-70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Mal 14, 66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Luk 22, 55-57</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Simo Piɛlɛ na motingami okina bakimanaka Yesu. Motingami ona okina adjebamaka na nganga monɛnɛ ɔ Ndjambe, aingea yo nɔbɔ Yesu ta otei ba tiangando ɛ ndako ɛ nganga monɛnɛ ɔ Ndjambe. <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />Endolo Piɛlɛ adika o sokolu, mbuti na edipako. Na bea motingami ona okina, ɔɔdjebamaka na nganga monɛnɛ ɔ Ndjambe, aimana osokolu ko abala na mwali ona ɔbaneaka edipako, ko aingedja Piɛlɛ. <verse eid="JHN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Mosali mwali ona ɔɔbaneaka edipako abala na Piɛlɛ boo: «Wɛ oditi koko, omɔti ɔ batingami ba moto onaho?» Piɛlɛ amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Pɛpɛ, editi mbai.» <verse eid="JHN 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Ɛdaka ehole ɛ piɔ; basali na basindjili ba tepelo bayodja mosa ko badaka baemi ena baoka. Piɛlɛ koko adaka aemi engbanga na bu ko aokaka mosa.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nganga monɛnɛ ɔ Ndjambe ahɔdjai Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mat 26, 59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mal 14, 55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Luk 22, 66-71</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Na bea nganga monɛnɛ ɔ Ndjambe ahɔdja Yesu diko la batingami ba nde ko diko la bileho ba nde. <verse eid="JHN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Yesu amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Nabala ohuu odii bato basusu; nalehaka maswi masusu ta ndako dja miongɔɔnɔ dja Bayuda ko ta tepelo, ta bisika bikasakane Bayuda basusu; naibala modjɔ momɔti ta mbombi. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Ɔhɔdjakani tina nda? Hɔdja odii bia ibaoka midjɔ imabala mbai na bu: ibo badjebaka opele, midjɔ mabala mbai.» <verse eid="JHN 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Ehole ɛbala Yesu bea, omɔti ɔ basindjili ibadaka ena aboma Yesu epataka ko abala na nde boo: «Moda masɔmbɛdjaka wɛ nganga monɛnɛ ɔ Ndjambe imua?» <verse eid="JHN 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Yesu amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Nga nakabala obe, inedjani obe bua; endolo ekadaa boo modjɔ mobali mbai modii sooti, tina ebomini na wɛ nda?» <verse eid="JHN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Ana amoloma anangi na mbɔti, odii Kaifa nganga monɛnɛ ɔ Ndjambe.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Piɛlɛ aingani Yesu mbala ɛ babae na ɛ basato</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Mat 26, 71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Mal 14, 69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Luk 22, 58-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Ta ehole ena, Simo Piɛlɛ, adaka aemi ena aoka mosa. Bamohɔdja boo: «Wɛ oditi, koko, omɔti ɔ batingami ba moto hoo?» Endolo Piɛlɛ amoingana abala boo: «Pɛpɛ, editi mbai.» <verse eid="JHN 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Omɔti ɔ basali ba nganga monɛnɛ ɔ Ndjambe, ɔdaka bwela ba moto ona ɔlena Piɛlɛ itoi, abala na nde boo: «Edii sooti wɛ ona oeni mbai nɔnɔ nde ta gue?» <verse eid="JHN 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Endolo Piɛlɛ amoingana mbala ekina. Oko ta ehole ena kɔkɔ akɔkɔlɔ.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu boso ba Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat 27, 1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">Mat 27, 11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mal 15, 1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luk 23, 1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Sɔɔ mɛɛnɛ, badonga odii Kaifa ko bakɛɛ na Yesu ta ndako ɛ gupunɛlɛ ɔ baloma. Bakumu ba Bayuda balona oingia ta ndako ɛ Pilato tina ɛ basakaimea mbindo ko bɛngɛ bayake mia ma Pasika. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Ta tina hee gupunɛlɛ Pilato akɛɛ abatanea o sokolu. Abahɔdja boo: «Modjɔ mapundakano moto hoo nda?» <verse eid="JHN 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Bamosɔmbɛdja boo: «Okɔki yo daa pɛpɛ oda moto mobe, eke lodoiti amokaba odii wɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Pilato abala na bu boo: «Motombani ino mɛɛnɛ ko mosambedjani okimana na mobeko ma boono.» Bamosɔmbɛdja boo: «Bayuda babala na nde boo loditi na enɔli ɛopa moto etumbu ɛ ogwa». <verse eid="JHN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Na bea bakokedja ebaeli ɛbala Yesu tina ɛ oinedja mondumba ma ogwa ba nde. <verse eid="JHN 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Bea Pilato aingea ta ndako; abea Yesu ko amohɔdja boo: «Odii kumu ɔ Bayuda?» <verse eid="JHN 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Yesu amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Modjɔ mua modongi odii wɛ mɛɛnɛ kaoko bato bakina babali na wɛ tina ɛ mbai?» <verse eid="JHN 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Pilato amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Edii mbai Moyuda? Edii denga la wɛ mɛɛnɛ na bakumu ba banganga ba Ndjambe ibo bato badoi aokaba odii mbai; modjɔ mokɔi wɛ nda?» <verse eid="JHN 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Yesu asɔmbɛdja boo: «Okumu ba mbai boditi ba ngondo hee; okɔki bo daa ba ngondo hee, basali ba mbai bakɔki ona bila bɛngɛ boo nadae pɛpɛ okabama odii bakumu ba Bayuda. Endolo, okumu ba mbai boditi ba ngondo hee.» <verse eid="JHN 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Bea Pilato abala na nde boo: «Bea odii kumu?» Yesu amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Wɛ moto obali boo: nadii kumu. Nabotama ko nadoa ta ngondo bɛngɛ napɛ tati diko la sooti. Moto na moto ona odii ta sooti akaoke bibaeli ba mbai.» <verse eid="JHN 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Pilato amohɔdja boo: «Edii sooti yee?»</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 18:38">Yesu adihi etumbu ɛ ogwa</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 18:38">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Mat 27, 15-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Mal 15, 6-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk 23, 13-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Ngɔngɔ dja obala bea, Pilato akɛɛ naikina osokolu odii Bayuda. Abala na bu boo: «Mbai nadihiti noko modjɔ momɔti maodumba moto hoo na ikambo. <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Endolo okimana na okimana na moda maekelanano, nakaotingoeni moto ɔ bɔlɔkɔ omɔti engi tɛkɛ ɛ Bayuda ɛ Pasika. Ɔpalakani boo naotingoeni kumu ɔ Bayuda?» <verse eid="JHN 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Basɔmbedja na ogama boo: «Ngasa, yo pɛpɛ! Endolo Balaba!» Ena bea, Balaba adaka moibi ko moowoli ɔ bato.<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Bea Pilato apa enɔli boo badoe na Yesu ko bamobome pimbo. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Basoda bayoa egbala ɛ ndjubɛ ko bayebakea ta molo ma Yesu; bamolwɛdja koko mokoto mokpetu. <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />Babatama na nde ko babala na nde boo: «Bwanda, kumu ɔ Bayuda!» Ko bamoboma bipataka. <verse eid="JHN 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Pilato aimani koko o sokolu ko abala na bu boo: «Naduake na nde haa, osokolu, bɛngɛ ɔdjebeni boo naeniti modjɔ mobe ta tei ɛ nde maomodumba na ikambo.» <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Bea Yesu aimana ena alwali egbala ɛ ndjubɛ na mokoto mokpetu. Ko Pilato abala na bu boo: «Hokeani moto!» <verse eid="JHN 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Endolo ehole ɛenɛ bakumu ba banganga ba Ndjambe na basindjili Yesu, bagama boo: «Ta ekulusu! Ta ekulusu!» Pilato abala na bu boo: «Motombani ino mɛɛnɛ ko mobakani ta ekulusu, tina ɛ boo mbai nadihiti modjɔ maomodumba na ikambo.» <verse eid="JHN 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Bayuda bamosɔmbɛdja boo: «Iso lodii na mobeko, ko okimana na mobeko mua eboani boo agwɛ, tina ɛ boo asaimedjaka Mwana ɔ Ndjambe.» <verse eid="JHN 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Ehole ɛoka Pilato ebaeli ena, adaa na bɔɔ bonɛnɛ. <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />Aingia ta ndako ko abala na Yesu boo: «Ekomi ɛ wɛ nda?» Endolo Yesu aimosɔmbɛdja. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Bea Pilato abala na nde boo: «Oloni osɔmbɛdjani? Otadjebaka boo nadii na kpati ɛ otingoa ko nadii koko na kpati ɛ obaka ta ekulusu?» <verse eid="JHN 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Yesu amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Oditi noko na kpati emɔti diko la mbai dongedjaka oko ena eopi Ndjambe. Na tina hee, moto okabini odii wɛ isumu la nde inɔi la wɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Donga ehole ena, Pilato ahombaka ndjia ɛ otingoa Yesu. Endolo Bayuda babanga ogama boo: «Okatingoa moto ona, oditi modjebaneli ɔ Kaisala! Moto mosusu okasaimedjae kumu, adii moini ɔ Kaisala!» <verse eid="JHN 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Ehole ɛoka Pilato ebaeli ena, aimanedja Yesu osokolu; adaa ta kiti ɛ djudji ta ndjia ɛ ndeke ekabee bo ta liebele«Gabata<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gabata, etingodjai ta liebele boo esika ɛtanda bo ndeke. </char></note>». <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Ɛdaka busa ba mosalingo ma tɛkɛ ɛ Bayuda ɛ Pasika, mbuti na ndanda ɛ busa. Pilato abala na Bayuda boo: «Hokeani Kumu ɔ boono!» <verse eid="JHN 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Endolo bagama boo: «Agwɛ! Agwɛ! Mobaka ta ekulusu!» Pilato abala na bu boo: «Nabake kumu ɔ boono ta ekulusu?» Bakumu ba banganga ba Ndjambe basɔmbɛdja boo: «Pɛpɛ okina Kumu odii na su dongedja oko Kaisala.» <verse eid="JHN 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Bea Pilato abapa Yesu boo bamobake ta ekulusu. Bea bakɛɛ na Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abakami ta ekulusu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat 27, 32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mal 15, 21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23, 26-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Yesu alwa ekulusu ɛ nde yo mɛɛnɛ tina ɛ oimana ta ibonga ko akɛɛ ta esika ɛbeaka bo ta liebele«Gologota<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gologota etingodjai ta liebele engbongolo ɛ molo. Ɛdaka esika ɛ diko mbuti na ibonga.</char></note>.» <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Edii ena esika ɛmobaka basoda ta ekulusu. Babaka koko bami babae ta bikulusu, omɔti ta dɔngɔ la ebɔ ɛ nde ɛ bami okina ta dɔngɔ la ebɔ ɛ bali, ko Yesu ndanda. <verse eid="JHN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Pilato apa koko enɔli boo bakome ikomi ko baliise diko la ekulusu; ɛɛkomama ena boo: «Yesu ɔ Nasaleta, kumu ɔ Bayuda.» <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Bayuda bike balanga ikomi dia, tina ɛ boo esika ɛbaka bo Yesu ta ekulusu ɛdaka mbuti na ibonga ko lakomama na kɔpɛ ɛ liebele, kɔpɛ ɛ Baloma ko na kɔpɛ ɛ gɛlɛke. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Bea bakumu ba banganga ba Ndjambe ba Bayuda babala na Pilato boo: «Oboaniti okina ikomi dii boo “kumu ɔ Bayuda”, endolo koma boo: “Moto hoo abali boo: Nadii kumu ɔ Bayuda.”» <verse eid="JHN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Pilato asɔmbɛdja boo: «Midjɔ imikomi mbai midikamalea oko moda mua.»<verse eid="JHN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Ehole ɛbaka basoda Yesu ta ekulusu, batomba bisendja ba nde ko babikaana na mabondo manei, tu soda la nde ibondo. Batomba koko mokoto ma nde, imadaka pɛpɛ otongama, madaka oko esendja emɔti donga odiko mbunoko nase. <verse eid="JHN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />Basoda basabaleana boo: «Lotakala mokoto muu, endolo labome djonga tina ɛ odjeba moto ndani omotombalea.» Ɛkɔɔmɔ bea bɛngɛ boo Ikomi dii lakokedjame:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">«Basakaanea bisendja ba mbai</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">ko baboma djonga tina ɛ mokoto ma mbai.»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">Hokea moda makɔɔ basoda.<verse eid="JHN 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Nɛngɛ Yesu adaka aemi mbuti na ekulusu, ngɛnɛ ɛ nango, Malia mwali ɔ Kolopasi na Malia ɔ Magadala. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Yesu aenɛ nango ko, mbuti na nde, motingami ona ɔpalaka yo. Abala na nango boo: «Mama, hokea mwana ɔ wɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Ngɔngɔ djia abala na motingami boo: «Hokea ngwao.» Ko donga ehole ena, motingami ona amotombi ta ndako ɛ nde.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ogwa ba Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27, 45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mal 15, 33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23, 44-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Ngɔngɔ djia, ena ɔdjeba Yesu boo midjɔ misusu mikoki, ta okokedja imakomama, abala boo: «Naoki posa ɛ madiba.» <verse eid="JHN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Ɛdaka ena na kulutu ɛlumake na vino ɛ ngai. Basoda badubea imbusu ta vino ɛ ngai, balihangea ta sɔngɔ ɛ mokɛɛlɛ ma isope ko balihweedja mbunoko ta monɔkɔ ma Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Ɔsidja Yesu omwa vino ɛ ngai abala boo: «Misusu mikoki!» Bea, asunea molo ma nde ko agwa.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Soda aindea mopandje ma Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Ɛdaka iswi la mosalingo ma sabata ko boo sabata ena ɛdaka iswi inɛnɛ, bakumu ba Bayuda baipalaka boo ndjemba dja bato djadikae ta bikulusu ta busa ba sabata; bea bakɛɛ ahɔdja Pilato boo babuke mako ma bato ibabakama ta ekulusu ko babadongedjae. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Basoda bakɛɛ ko babuka mako ma moto ɔ boso ko ma moto ɔ babae ibabakama na Yesu engbanga. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Ɔimea bo odii Yesu, baenɛ boo asii ogwa; ta tina hee baibuka mako ma nde. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Endolo omɔti ɔ basoda aindea mopandje ma nde na ikɔngɔ, ko makia na madiba maimana ena ambuku. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Moto ona ɔpaka tati ɛ midjɔ mia misusu imanɔɔ amienɛ na miso ma nde, ko tati ɛ nde edii sooti, yo adjebi boo, abali sooti. Apa tati ena bɛngɛ boo ino koko ɔdhimeni. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Na tina hee, midjɔ mia misusu makɔɔmɔ tina ɛ okokedja Ikomi: «Babuketebi noko mokua ma nde momɔti.» <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />Ikomi likina libali koko boo: «Bahokeabi odii ona ɔindea bo.»<verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Opuseama ba Yesu ta ikila</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27, 57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mal 15, 42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23, 50-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Ngɔngɔ djia, Yosepu, moto ɔ Alimate, ahɔdja Pilato enɔli boo atombe ndjemba ɛ Yesu. – Yosepu adaka motingami ɔ Yesu, endolo na mbombi tina ɛ boo abangaka bakumu ba Bayuda. – Ko Pilato amopa enɔli. Bea Yosepu akɛɛ ko atomba ndjemba ɛ Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Nikodɛmɛ, ona ɔkɛkɛ odii Yesu na bulu, adoa koko na kilo mbuti na tuku isato dja munɛ ma mile na aloesi idjasanganedja bo. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Ibo basusu babae batomba ndjemba ɛ Yesu ko bayedinga na biale ba bisendja bipu, ibasopea bo minɛ ma malasi, moda maa ekelana Bayuda opusea bato ba bobo. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Ta esika ɛbakabo Yesu ta ekulusu, gue emɔti ɛdaka ena, ko ta gue ena ikila iladaa bo pɛpɛ okunda moto boso ladaka. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Bapusea Yesu ena tina ɛ boo ɛdaka iswi la mosalingo ma sabata ɛ Bayuda ko tina ɛ boo ikila ladaka mbuti.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s1">Opusoama ba Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mat 28, 1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mal 16, 1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24, 1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Sɔɔ mɛɛnɛ ta busa ba eyenga, ɛdaka oko modidi, Malia ɔ Magadala akɛɛ ta ikila. Aenɛ boo mondeke madongedjama ta eingeli ɛ ikila. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Bea apeta ebango tina osaka na Simo Piɛlɛ ko na motingami ona ɔpalaka Yesu, abala na bu boo: «Badɔngedjai Kumu ta ikila, ko lotadjeba esika emoisi bo.» <verse eid="JHN 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Piɛlɛ na motingami ona okina baimana ko bakɛɛ ta ikila. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Bea papeta ibo basusu babae; endolo motingami ona okina anɔɔ Piɛlɛ na ebango ko aimea boso ta ikila. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />Asunama tina ɛ oindja ko aenɛ biale ba bisendja ibakunda na bu Yesu bisambi ta kpɔtɔ, endolo aiwaingea. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Ɔimea Simo Piɛlɛ, ona ɔdoa ngɔngɔ dja nde, aingea ta ikila. Aenɛ biale ba bisendja bisambi ta kpɔtɔ <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />ko na yale ɛ esendja ena ɛhuaka molo ma Yesu; yale ena ɛ esendja ɛidaka na biale ba bisendja bikina esika emɔti, endolo ɛdaka ebulukamake esika ekina. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Na bea, motingami ona okina, ona ɔimeaka boso ta ikila, aingea koko. Aenɛ ko adhima. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />Tina ɛ boo batingami baipakasipoa Makomi imadjebedjaka boo Yesu aboanaka opusoa ta ndanda ɛ bago. <verse eid="JHN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Ngɔngɔ djia batingami bia babae basɔmbɔ odii bo.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu asaenɛmɛdjai na Malia ɔ Magadala</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mat 28, 9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Mal 16, 9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Malia adaka aemi, o sokolu, mbuti na ikila, ko ayeaka. Ena ɔdaka yo ayea, asunama tina ɛ ohokea ta ikila; <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />aenɛ babwɛndi babae na bisendja bipu badii ta esika ɛsambea bo ndjemba ɛ Yesu, omɔti ta dɔngɔ la molo, okina ta dɔngɔ la mako. <verse eid="JHN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Babwɛndi bamohɔdja boo: «Tina ɛyeaka na wɛ nda?» Abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Badongedjai Kumu ɔ mbai ko natadjebaka esika emoisi bo.» <verse eid="JHN 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Ngɔngɔ dja obala bea, ahombana ko aenɛ Yesu ona ɔdaka aemi ena, endolo aidjeba boo ɛdaka Yo. <verse eid="JHN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Yesu amohɔdja boo: «Tina ɛyiaka na wɛ nda? Ɔhombaka wɛ nda?» Alɛdjaka boo ɛdaka mosali ɔ gue, ta tina hee abala na nde boo: «Kumu, ekada wɛ moto omotombi, tɔndɔni esika emoisi wɛ, ko nakɛlea amotomba.» <verse eid="JHN 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Yesu abala na nde boo: «Malia!» Malia ahombana odii yo ko abala na nde na kɔpɛ ɛ liebele boo: «Labuni!» – Etingodjai boo «Molehi». <verse eid="JHN 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Yesu abala na nde boo: «Pɛpɛ opeani, tina ɛ boo napakita sɔmbɔ odii Tata. Endolo kɛɛ atɔndɔe banainga boo nasɔmbi odii Tata ona odii Sangwanu koko, odii Ndjambe ɔ mbai ona odii Ndjambe ɔ boono koko.» <verse eid="JHN 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Bea Malia ɔ Magadala akɛɛ adjebedja batingami boo: «Mbai naeni Kumu!» Ko abatɔndɔ midjɔ imabala yo na nde.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu asaenɛmɛdjai na batingami ba nde</para>
  <para style="r">(Hokea koko <ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat 28, 16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mal 16, 14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24, 36-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Mɔkɔmɔkɔ ma busa bua ba eyenga, batingami badaka baboli ta otei ba ndako. Badipa bidipako na fungola, tina ɛ boo badaka na bɔɔ ba bakumu ba Bayuda. Yesu adoa ko aema ta ndanda ɛ bobo, abala na bu boo: «Yɛɛ ogoo badae na nu!» <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Ngɔngɔ dja obala bea, abainedja mabɔ ma nde na mopandje ma nde. Batingami baluma na sepi ɔenɛ bo Kumu. <verse eid="JHN 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Yesu abala na bu koko boo: «Yɛɛ ogoo badae na nu! Oko moda imalomani Tata, mbai koko naolomini.» <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Ngɔngɔ dja bibaeli bia, abahwea mohuli ko abala na bu boo: «Osɔni Mwembo Mosɛnɔke! <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />Odii ibia bayɛɛbino masumu ma bobo bayɛɛmɛbi; odii bia ibalonabino oyɛɛmɛ bayɛɛmetebi.»<verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na Toma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Bea, omɔti ɔ batingami doomi na babae, Toma – ona ɔbeakabo Ipasa – aidaka na bu engbanga ehole ɛdoa Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Batingami bakina babala na nde boo: «Loeni Kumu.» Endolo Toma abasɔmbɛdja boo: «Namiti enɛ pola dja sɛtɛ ta mabɔ ma nde, namiti isa mosapi ma mbai ta pola dja sɛtɛ ko ebɔ ɛ mbai ta mopandje ma nde, nadhimetelea.» <verse eid="JHN 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Ngɔngɔ dja eyenga emɔti, batingami badaka baboli koko ta ndako, ko Toma adaka engbanga na bu. Bidipako bisusu badaka bidipi na fungola, endolo Yesu adoa ko aemaa ta ndanda ɛ bobo, abala na bu boo: «Ogoo badae na nu!» <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Bea Yesu abala na Toma boo: «Isa mosapi ma wɛ haa ko hokea mabɔ ma mbai; linda ebɔ ɛ wɛ ko yeisa ta mopandje ma mbai. Kina oboma kitɛ ko dhima!» <verse eid="JHN 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Toma amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Kumu ɔ mbai ko Ndjambe ɔ mbai!» <verse eid="JHN 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Yesu abala na nde boo: «Odhimi oko ta tina ɛ boo oenini? Sepi odii bia ibadimi pɛpɛ oenɛni!»<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tina ɛ mokanda muu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Yesu akɔɔ koko, boso ba batingami ba nde, bimbete bike ba okamoa ibada pɛpɛ okomama ta mokanda muu <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />Endolo bii bakomama bɛngɛ ɔdhimeni boo Yesu adii Masia, Mwana ɔ Ndjambe, ko okamodhimeani, ɔdihebini mohelo ta kombe ɛ nde.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu asaenɛmɛdjai na batingami ba nde saambo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Ngɔngɔ dja maswii, Yesu asaenɛmɛdja koko odii batingami ba nde, ta ibongu la ibeke inɛnɛ la Tibelia. Hokea moda masaenɛmɛdja yo: <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Simo Piɛlɛ, Toma – ɔbeakabo Ipasa –, Natanaɛlɛ – ona ɔdaka moto ɔ Kana ta Galilai –, bana ba Djebedai, ko na bakina batingami babae ba Yesu, badaka engbanga. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Simo Piɛlɛ abala nabu boo: «Nakɛi aluba.» Babala na nde boo: «Iso koko, lakeke na wɛ engbanga.» Bea bakɛɛ na nde ko batitea ta bwato. Endolo baitɛdja noko eka bulu bua. <verse eid="JHN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Ena ɔbanga busa oya, Yesu adaka aemi ta ibongu, endolo batingami baidjebaka boo ɛdaka Yo. <verse eid="JHN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Bea Yesu abala na bu boo: «Bana ba mbai, oditini na swi?» Bamosɔmbɛdja boo: «Ngasa.» <verse eid="JHN 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Abala na bu boo: «Maani modjanga ta ebɔ ɛ bami ɛ bwato ko odihaleani.» Bea bamaa modjanga, ko baihɔnɔ omokola ta madiba, ɛlɔkɛɛ boo maluma na swi. <verse eid="JHN 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Bea motingami ona ɔpalaka Yesu abala na Piɛlɛ boo: «Edii Kumu!» Ehole ɛoka Simo Piɛlɛ bibaeli bia boo: «Edii Kumu», alwa esendja ɛ nde ɛ diko, tina ɛ boo ayeihwaka tina ɛ oluba, ko asamaa ta madiba. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Batingami bakina basɔmbɛdja bwato ta ibongu, ena ɔdaka bo batuba modjanga imaluma otɔɔ na swi: baidaka ohali na ibongu, mbuti na mɛtɛlɛ mokama. <verse eid="JHN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Ehole ɛduboabo o ngondo, baenɛ malo ma mosa na swi babaki diko la mu, ko na mapa. <verse eid="JHN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Yesu abala na bu boo: «Doani na ekenge ɛ swi ibahulakeno atɛɛdja.» <verse eid="JHN 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Simo Piɛlɛ atitea ta bwato ko atuba modjanga o ngondo molumake na swi ibanɛnɛnɛ mokama na tuku itano na basato. Noko ɔdaka swi bike, modjanga maikalea. <verse eid="JHN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Yesu abala na bu boo: «Doa ayakeni.» Pɛpɛ noko motingami omɔti omeka omohɔdja boo: «Wɛ nda?» Tina ɛ badjebaka boo ɛdaka Kumu. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Yesu abatama, atomba ipa ko abakaanea lo; aiko bapa koko moswi. <verse eid="JHN 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Ɛdaka mbala ɛ basato ɛsaenɛmɛdja Yesu odii batingami ba nde, donga opusoama ba nde ta ndanda ɛ bago.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na Piɛlɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Ngɔngɔ dja oyaka, Yesu ahɔdja Simo Piɛlɛ boo: «Simo, mwana ɔ Yoani, okapaleni onɔ moda mokapaleni bii?» Amosɔmbɛdja boo: – «Edii bea, Kumu, ɔdjebaka boo nakaopale.» Yesu abala na nde boo: «Banea bhata ba mbai.» <verse eid="JHN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Bea amohɔdja mbala ɛ babae: «Simo, mwana ɔ Yoani, okapaleni?» – Amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Edii bea, Kumu, ɔdjebaka boo nakaopale.» Yesu abala na nde boo: «Banea bhata ba mbai.» <verse eid="JHN 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Bea amohɔdja mbala ɛ basato boo: «Simo, mwana ɔ Yoani, okapaleni?» Piɛlɛ aoka ndjokwa ta molema ena ɔmohɔdja Yesu mbala ɛ basato boo: «Okapaleni?» Ko amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Kumu, ɔdjebaka midjɔ misusu; ɔdjebaka boo nakaopale!» Yesu abala na nde boo: «Banea bhata ba mbai. <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />Edii bea, nabali na wɛ sooti: ehole ɛdaka wɛ yɛngɛ, osalwɛdjaka mosenge ma wɛ ko ɔkɛkɛ dɔngɔ lapalaka wɛ; endolo ehole eimeabi wɛ mobange, oninodjabi mabɔ, ko okina aolwɛdjabi mosenge ko akebi na wɛ dɔngɔ lidii wɛ pɛpɛ opala okɛɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />Yesu abala bibaeli bia oinedja moda mogwabi na Piɛlɛ tina ɛ ekumu ɛ Ndjambe. Ngɔngɔ djia abala na nde boo: «Kimanani!»<verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na motingami ona ɔpalaka yo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Piɛlɛ ahokea sangɔngɔ ko aenɛ motingami ona ɔpalaka Yesu onɔdja batingami bakina – ona odaka aheki dɔngɔ la Yesu ta ehole ɛyaka bo ko amohɔdja boo: «Kumu, ona ookabalea nda?» – <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Ehole ɛmoenɛ Piɛlɛ ahɔdja Yesu boo: «Kumu, modjɔ mokɔmɔbi na nde nda?» <verse eid="JHN 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Yesu amosɔmbɛdja boo: «Nga nakapala boo ahelame mbunoko ehole esɔmbɔbi mbai, ma wɛ nda? Wɛ, kimanani!» <verse eid="JHN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Na bea ngala ɛnangana odii denga boo motingami ona atagwa. Endolo Yesu aibala na Piɛlɛ boo: «Agwɛtebi», endolo abala wɛte boo: «Nga nakapala boo ahelame mbunoko osɔmbɔ ba mbai, ma wɛ nda?»<verse eid="JHN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Edii oko motingami ona ɔɔpaka tati ɛ midjɔ mia ko ɔmikoma, ko lodjebi boo tati ɛ nde edii sooti.<verse eid="JHN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ta osukedja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Yesu akɔɔ midjɔ mikina mike. Nga makomama momɔti na momɔti, nalɛdji boo ngondo esusu etabolodja esika eobomba buku idjakɔkɔ komama.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>